si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "Precautions for Removing Battery Terminal", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "With the adoption of Auto ACC function, ACC power is automatically supplied by operating the Keyless operation key or remote keyless entry or by opening/closing the driver side door. In addition, ACC power is supplied even after the ignition switch is turned to the OFF position, i.e. ACC power is supplied for a certain fixed time.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "When disconnecting the 12V battery terminal, turn off the ACC power before disconnecting the 12V battery terminal, observing “How to disconnect 12V battery terminal” described below.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "Some ECUs operate for a certain fixed time even after ignition switch is turned OFF and ignition power supply is stopped. If the battery terminal is disconnected before ECU stops, accidental DTC detection or ECU data damage may occur.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "For vehicles with the 2-batteries, be sure to connect the main battery and the sub battery before turning ON the ignition switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "If the ignition switch is turned ON with any one of the terminals of main battery and sub battery disconnected, then DTC may be detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "After installing the 12V battery, always check the DTC of all ECUs and erase DTC.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "The removal of 12V battery may cause a DTC detection error.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "HOW TO DISCONNECT 12V BATTERY TERMINAL", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "Disconnect 12V battery terminal according to instruction described below.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "Open the hood.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "Turn ignition switch to the ON position.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "Turn ignition switch to the OFF position with the driver side door opened.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "Get out of the vehicle and close the driver side door.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "Wait at least 3 minutes.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "While waiting, never operate the vehicle such as locking, opening, and closing doors. Violation of this caution results in the activation of ACC power supply according to the Auto ACC function.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "Remove 12V battery terminal.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203P0000K00ENG.html", "After installing 12V battery, always check the DTC of all ECUs and erase DTC.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Precautions For Engine Service", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "DISCONNECTING FUEL PIPING", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Before starting work, check no fire or spark producing items are in the work area.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Release fuel pressure before disconnecting and disassembly.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "After disconnecting pipes, plug openings to stop fuel leakage.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "DRAINING ENGINE COOLANT", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Drain engine coolant and engine oil when the engine is cooled.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "INSPECTION, REPAIR AND REPLACEMENT", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Before repairing or replacing, thoroughly inspect parts. Inspect new replacement parts in the same way, and replace if necessary.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "When replacing or inspecting air cleaner element, remove foreign matter inside air duct, on air cleaner element surface, and inside cleaner case.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "REMOVAL AND DISASSEMBLY", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "When instructed to use SST, use specified tools. Always be careful to work safely, avoid forceful or uninstructed operations.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Exercise maximum care to avoid damage to mating or sliding surfaces.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Dowel pins are used for several parts alignment. When replacing and reassembling parts with dowel pins, check that dowel pins are installed in the original position.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Must cover openings of engine system with a tape or equivalent, to seal out foreign materials.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Mark and arrange disassembly parts in an organized way for easy troubleshooting and reassembly.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "When loosening nuts and bolts, as a basic rule, start with the one furthest outside, then the one diagonally opposite, and so on. If the order of loosening is specified, do exactly as specified. Power tools may be used in the step.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "ASSEMBLY AND INSTALLATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Use torque wrench to tighten bolts or nuts to specification.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "When tightening nuts and bolts, as a basic rule, equally tighten in several different steps starting with the ones in center, then ones on inside and outside diagonally in this order. If the order of tightening is specified, do exactly as specified.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Before removing or installing any intake-system-related parts, thoroughly clean them to prevent foreign matter from entering inside engine.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Replace with new gasket, packing, oil seal or O-ring.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Thoroughly wash, clean, and air-blow each part. Carefully check engine oil or engine coolant passages for any restriction and blockage.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Avoid damaging sliding or mating surfaces. Completely remove foreign materials such as cloth lint or dust. Before assembly, oil sliding surfaces well.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "After disassembling, or exposing any internal engine parts, change engine oil and replace oil filter with a new one.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "Release air within route when refilling after draining engine coolant.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020203O0000J00ENG.html", "After repairing, start the engine and increase engine speed to check engine coolant, fuel, engine oil, and exhaust gases for leakage.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "Liquid Gasket", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "REMOVAL OF LIQUID GASKET SEALING", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "After removing mounting nuts and bolts, separate the mating surface using the seal cutter [SST: KV10111100] (A) and remove old liquid gasket sealing.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "Never damage the mating surfaces.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "Tap the seal cutter [SST: KV10111100] to insert it , and then slide it  by tapping on the side as shown in the figure.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "In areas where the seal cutter [SST: KV10111100] is difficult to use, lightly tap the parts using a plastic hammer to remove it.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "If for some unavoidable reason tool such as a screwdriver is used, be careful not to damage the mating surfaces.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "LIQUID GASKET APPLICATION PROCEDURE", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "Using a scraper (A), remove old liquid gasket adhering to the liquid gasket application surface and the mating surface.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "Remove liquid gasket completely from the groove of the liquid gasket application surface, mounting bolts, and bolt holes.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "Wipe the liquid gasket application surface and the mating surface with white gasoline (lighting and heating use) to remove adhering moisture, grease and foreign materials.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "Attach liquid gasket tube to the tube presser (commercial service tool).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "Use Genuine Liquid Gasket or equivalent.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "Apply liquid gasket without gaps to the specified location according to the specified dimensions.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "If there is a groove for liquid gasket application, apply liquid gasket to the groove.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "As for bolt holes , normally apply liquid gasket inside the holes. Occasionally, it should be applied outside the holes. Check to read the text of this manual.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", ": Groove", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", ": Inside", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "Within five minutes of liquid gasket application, install the mating component.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "If liquid gasket protrudes, wipe it off immediately.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "Do not retighten mounting bolts or nuts after the installation.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "After 30 minutes or more have passed from the installation, fill engine oil and engine coolant.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020204T0000D00ENG.html", "If there are specific instructions in this manual, observe them.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020409R0001200ENG.html", "Special Service Tools", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020409R0001200ENG.html", "When you order special service tool, use part number on \"tool order number\" of special service tool number substitution list. Refer to", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020409R0001200ENG.html", "Tool number", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5020409R0001200ENG.html", "Tool name", "ptxt");
