si[i++] = gsitm("N5022405P0000L00ENG.html", "How to Read DTC and 1st Trip DTC", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5022405P0000L00ENG.html", "DTCs and 1st trip DTCs related to the malfunction are displayed in \"Self-diagnosis\" mode with M.U.T.-III SE. Status of DTCs is displayed as follows.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5022405P0000L00ENG.html", "When ECM has detected a current DTC, \"Active DTC\" is displayed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5022405P0000L00ENG.html", "When ECM memorizes a 1st trip DTC, \"1t\" is displayed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5022405P0000L00ENG.html", "For a DTC other than the above, \"Stored DTC\" is displayed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5022405P0000L00ENG.html", "How to Erase DTC", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5022405P0000L00ENG.html", "If the ignition switch stays ON after repair work, be sure to turn ignition switch OFF once. Wait at least 10 seconds and then turn it ON (engine stopped) again.", "ptxt");
