si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003U0000A00ENG.html", "METHOD OF READING AND ERASING DIAGNOSTIC CODES", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003U0000A00ENG.html", "Refer to General Information - General Information - Basic Inspection - M.U.T.-III SE Checking System .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "CHECK PROCEDURE FOR EACH MULTI INFORMATION DISPLAY SCREEN", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "When there are TV towers, substations, or broadcasting stations which emit strong radio waves in proximity, on rare occasions, a warning is displayed on the multi information screen for a few seconds. This is caused by the reception of strong radio waves, and there is no functional problem.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "WARNING SCREEN", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "When malfunctions occur to the vehicle, the following warning screens are displayed. If these screens are not displayed normally or if they continue to be displayed even after the factor is eliminated, take measures according to the action procedure.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "Display content", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "Message", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "Factor", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "Action procedure", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "High Coolant temp", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "Stop Vehicle", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "See Owner\'s Manual", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "Displayed when overheated.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "If the warning screen is not displayed normally or if the screen continues to be displayed, check the Symptom Procedures 17: Overheating (Refer to ).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "Auto Stop & Go System Fault", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "This message is displayed when the Auto Stop & Go is malfunctioning.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "If the screen continues to be displayed, check the DI and MPI system diagnosis code, and troubleshoot the set diagnosis code (Refer to ).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "Auto Stop & Go Not Available", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "If the engine stops when the Auto Stop & Go is activated, and will not start automatically, the message is shown.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "When this warning screen is displayed, the Auto Start does not operate. Therefore, start the engine by using the engine switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003T0000A00ENG.html", "NOTE: If the engine hood is opened while the Auto Stop is operating this warning screen will be displayed and the buzzer will sound.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003V0000B00ENG.html", "AS&G OFF DISPLAY SCREEN", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003V0000B00ENG.html", "When the AS&G OFF switch is depressed, the AS&G system should be turned OFF and the AS&G OFF display screen should be turned ON. When the following items in the table, related to the AS&G system, are abnormal, the AS&G OFF display screen should blink and the warning message is displayed on the multi information display. When the AS&G OFF display screen continues to blink, check the output of diagnosis code.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003V0000B00ENG.html", "If no diagnosis code is set, the ECM has received abnormal signal from the CVT system. Check data list item No. 97 to check which system is defective.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003V0000B00ENG.html", "After the ignition switch is turned ON, the AS&G OFF display screen should be turned ON for several seconds so that the display can be checked for the normal operation.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003V0000B00ENG.html", "If the engine hood is opened during the auto stop, the vehicle shifts to the normal engine stop state. At this time, the AS&G OFF display screen turns ON and the tone alarm sounds simultaneously. In addition, a message \"Auto Stop & Go Not Available\" will be displayed on the information display. When restarting the engine, the ignition switch needs to be operated.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003V0000B00ENG.html", "ITEMS TO BLINK AS&G OFF DISPLAY SCREEN", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025003V0000B00ENG.html", "Diagnosis Code", "ptxt");
