si[i++] = gsitm("N502500430000A00ENG.html", "After the ECM detects a malfunction, a diagnostic trouble code is recorded the next time the engine is started and the same malfunction is re-detected. However, for items marked with a \"*\", the diagnostic trouble code is recorded on the first detection of the malfunction.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025042A0000400ENG.html", "Code No. C0032-00: Vehicle speed sensor FL out of range high", "title");
