si[i++] = gsitm("N5025004Q0000900ENG.html", "Check high-pressure fuel line and fuel line.", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025004Q0000900ENG.html", "By a visual inspection and odor inspection, check around the high-pressure fuel line from the fuel pump (high pressure) to the fuel injector (high pressure), and around the fuel line. Ensure that there is not fuel seepage and fuel leaks.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025004Q0000900ENG.html", "Remove the spark plug and check whether you smell the fuel from the plug hole or not. If you smell fuel, check a fuel leak from the fuel injector (high pressure).", "ptxt");
