si[i++] = gsitm("N5025005A0000500ENG.html", "Check of harness damage in ATS line between air flow sensor connector and ECM connector.", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025005A0000500ENG.html", "Using scan tool (M.U.T.-IIISE), check data list item 5: No. 1 Intake Air Temperature Sensor.", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025005A0000500ENG.html", "Set scan tool (M.U.T.-IIISE) to the data reading mode for item 5, Air Temperature Sensor.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025005A0000500ENG.html", "The intake air temperature and temperature shown with the scan tool should approximately match.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025005A0000500ENG.html", "It can be assumed that this malfunction is intermittent. Refer to General Information - General Information - Basic Inspection - Service Information for Electrical Incident - .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025005A0000500ENG.html", "Replace the ECM (Refer to ). Then GO TO 7.", "ptxt");
