si[i++] = gsitm("N5025007P0000800ENG.html", "A power voltage of 5 V is applied to the EGR differential pressure sensor power terminal from the ECM connector terminal EGR5 and grounded to the ECM connector terminal EGRE from the EGR differential pressure sensor connector ground terminal.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5025007P0000800ENG.html", "The sensor signal is input to the ECM connector terminal EGDP from the exhaust differential pressure sensor output terminal.", "ptxt");
