si[i++] = gsitm("N502500860000500ENG.html", "A power voltage of 5 V is applied to the A/C pressure sensor power terminal from the ECM connector terminal ACP5 and grounded to the ECM　connector terminal ACPE　from the A/C pressure sensor connector ground terminal.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502500860000500ENG.html", "The sensor signal is inputted to the ECM connector terminal AC/P from the A/C pressure sensor output terminal.", "ptxt");
