si[i++] = gsitm("N502501080000800ENG.html", "Current malfunction", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502501080000800ENG.html", "The failure is possibly caused by malfunction of the harness and connector in CAN bus line between ECM (Cruise control portion) and ADAS control unit 2, by malfunction of in ADAS control unit 2, in ECM (Cruise control portion).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502501080000800ENG.html", "Past malfunction", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502501080000800ENG.html", "Proceed with troubleshooting focusing on malfunction of the harness and connector in CAN bus line between ECM (Cruise control portion) and ADAS control unit 2.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502501080000800ENG.html", "In the case of past malfunctions, M.U.T.-III SE CAN bus line diagnosis cannot detect a malfunction even if there is a malfunction in CAN bus. Therefore, check CAN bus line as in the case of response to intermittent malfunctions (Refer to General Information - General Information - Basic Inspection - Service Information for Electrical Incident - ). It is possible to narrow down areas with a high possibility of malfunctions from diagnosis codes set in each ECU that performs CAN communication (Refer to Electrical and Power Control - LAN System - CAN Fundamental - Basic Inspection - Diagnosis and Repair Workflow - ).", "ptxt");
