si[i++] = gsitm("N5025011Q0000500ENG.html", "In the case of past malfunctions, M.U.T.-III SE CAN bus line diagnosis cannot detect a malfunction even if there is a malfunction in CAN bus. Therefore, check CAN bus line as in the case of response to intermittent malfunctions (Refer to General Information – Basic Inspection – Service Information for Electrical Incident – ). It is possible to narrow down areas with a high possibility of malfunctions from diagnosis trouble codes set in each ECU that performs CAN communication (Refer to Electrical and Power Control – LAN System – CAN Fundamental – Basic Inspection –  Diagnosis and Repair Workflow – ).If diagnosis trouble code U0101-00 is set in the ECM, surely perform CAN bus line diagnosis.", "ptxt");
