si[i++] = gsitm("N5025012C0000700ENG.html", "In the case of past malfunctions, M.U.T.-III SE CAN bus line diagnosis cannot detect a malfunction even if there is a malfunction in CAN bus. Therefore, check CAN bus line as in the case of response to intermittent malfunctions (Refer to General Information - General Information - Basic Inspection - Service Information for Electrical Incident - ). It is possible to narrow down areas with a high possibility of malfunctions from diagnosis codes set in each ECU that performs CAN communication (Refer to Electrical and Power Control - LAN System - CAN Fundamental - Basic Inspection - Diagnosis and Repair Workflow - ).", "ptxt");
