si[i++] = gsitm("N502501470000600ENG.html", "If the AS&G is still inactive even after the procedure above is performed, the AS&G may be prohibited by request of the 48V system side. Therefore, check the 48V system and replace the ECM if the system is normal (Refer to ).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502501470000600ENG.html", "Intermittent malfunction (Refer to General Information – General Information – Basic Inspection – Service Information for Electrical Incident – ).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502501480000700ENG.html", "Inspection Procedure 17: AS&G System Abnormal (auto start not carried out)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502501480000700ENG.html", "If the engine hood is opened during the auto stop, the vehicle shifts to the normal engine stop state. At this time, the AS&G OFF display screen turns ON and the buzzer sounds simultaneously. In addition, a message \"Auto Stop & Go Not Available.\" will be displayed on the information display. When restarting the engine, the ignition switch needs to be operated.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502501480000700ENG.html", "TECHNICAL DESCRIPTION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502501480000700ENG.html", "When the driver release the brake pedal during the auto stop, the ECM will restart the engine.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502501480000700ENG.html", "COMMENTS ON TROUBLE SYMPTOM", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502501480000700ENG.html", "The failure could possibly be caused by the failed AS&G system. The ECM, however, can possibly prohibit the auto start, depending on the vehicle status or the ambient conditions.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502501480000700ENG.html", "TROUBLESHOOTING HINTS (The most likely causes for this code to be set are:)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502501480000700ENG.html", "Failed 48V system.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N502501480000700ENG.html", "Failed ECM.", "ptxt");
