si[i++] = gsitm("N5025002F0000701ENG.html", "Stop the engine and check change of fuel pressure gauge reading. Normal if the reading does not drop within 2 minutes. If it does, observe the rate of drop and troubleshoot and repair according to the table below.", "ptxt");
