si[i++] = gsitm("N5040208N0001B00ENG.html", "In M.U.T.-III SE, electric shift timing or lock-up timing, i.e. operation timing of each solenoid valve, is displayed. Therefore, if there is an obvious difference between the shift timing estimated from a shift shock (or engine speed variations) and that shown on the M.U.T.-III SE, the mechanism parts (including the hydraulic circuit) excluding the solenoids and sensors may be malfunctioning. In this case, check the mechanical parts following the appropriate diagnosis procedure.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5040208N0001B00ENG.html", "Shift point (gear position) displayed on M.U.T.-III SE slightly differs from shift pattern described in Service Manual. This is due to the following reasons.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5040208N0001B00ENG.html", "Actual shift pattern may vary slightly within specified tolerances.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5040208N0001B00ENG.html", "While shift pattern described in Service Manual indicates start of each shift, M.U.T.-III SE shows gear position at end of shift.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5040208N0001B00ENG.html", "The solenoid display (ON/OFF) on M.U.T.-III SE is changed at the start of gear shifting. In contrast, the gear position display is changed at the time when gear shifting calculated in the control unit is completed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5040208N0001B00ENG.html", "The following table includes information (items) inapplicable to this vehicle. For information (items) applicable to this vehicle, refer to M.U.T.-III SE display items.", "ptxt");
