si[i++] = gsitm("N5040201J0002R00ENG.html", "TCM has a fail-safe function. This function enables driving safely even if the signal circuit of an input/output is damaged.If the vehicle shows some behavior including \"unexpected deceleration\", a malfunction of the applicable system is detected by TCM and the vehicle may be in a fail-safe mode. At this time, check the DTC and inspect and repair according to the malfunction diagnosis procedures.", "ptxt");
