si[i++] = gsitm("N5060103H0003T00ENG.html", "Replace the shims and shim covers if rust is excessively attached.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060103H0003T00ENG.html", "Eliminate rust on the pad and the torque member. Replace them if rust is excessively attached.", "ptxt");
