si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "System Description", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "Side slip or tail slip may occur while driving on a slippery road or intending an urgent evasive driving. ASC function detects side slip status using each sensor when side slip or tail slip is about to occur and improves vehicle stability by brake control and engine output control during driving.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "In addition to TCS function, ABS function and EBD function, target side slip amount is calculated according to steering operation amount from steering angle sensor and brake operation amount from pressure sensor. By comparing this information with vehicle side slip amount that is calculated from information from yaw rate/side G sensor and wheel sensor, vehicle driving conditions (conditions of understeer or oversteer) are judged and vehicle stability is improved by brake force control on all 4 wheels and engine output control.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "ASC function can be switched to non-operational status (OFF). In this case, ASC OFF indicator light turns ON.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "Control unit portion automatically improves driving stability by performing brake force control as well as engine output control, by transmitting drive signal to actuator portion according to difference between target side slip amount and vehicle side slip amount.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "ASC warning light blinks while ASC function is in operation and indicates to the driver that the function is in operation.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "M.U.T.-III SE can be used to diagnose the system diagnosis.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "Fail-safe function is adopted. When a malfunction occurs in ASC function, the control is suspended for ASC function, TCS function, brake limited slip differential (BLSD) function, brake assist function, brake force distribution function, and hill start assist function. The vehicle status becomes the same as models without ASC function, TCS function, brake limited slip differential (BLSD) function, brake assist function, brake force distribution function, hill start assist function, and hill decent control. However, ABS function and EBD function are operated normally. Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "ASC has the characteristic as described here, This is not the device that helps reckless driving.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "SYSTEM DIAGRAM", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "INPUT SIGNAL AND OUTPUT SIGNAL", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "Major signal transmission between each unit via communication lines is shown in the following table.", "ptxt");
