si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "ASC warning light signal", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "OPERATION CHARACTERISTICS", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "ASC Function That Prevents Oversteer Tendency", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "During a cornering, brake force (brake fluid pressure) is applied on front wheel and rear wheel on the outer side of turn. Moment directing towards the outer side of turn is generated. Oversteer is prevented.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "Changing driving lane on a slippery road, when oversteer tendency is judged large, engine output is controlled as well as brake force (brake fluid pressure) of 4 wheels. Oversteer tendency decreases.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "ASC Function That Prevents Understeer Tendency", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "During a cornering, brake force (brake fluid pressure) is applied on front wheel and rear wheel on the inner side of turn. Moment directing towards the inner side of turn is generated. Understeer is prevented.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004D00ENG.html", "Applying braking during a cornering on a slippery road, when understeer tendency is judged large, engine output is controlled as well as brake force (brake fluid pressure) of four wheels. Understeer tendency decreases.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004E00ENG.html", "System Description", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004E00ENG.html", "Wheel spin status of drive wheel is detected by wheel sensor of 4 wheels. Engine output and transmission shift status is controlled so that slip rate of drive wheels is in appropriate level. When wheel spin occurs on drive wheel, ABS actuator and electric unit (control unit) perform brake force control of LH and RH drive wheels (apply brake force by increasing brake fluid pressure of drive wheel) and decrease engine torque by engine torque control. Wheel spin amount decreases. Engine torque is controlled to appropriate level.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004E00ENG.html", "TCS function can be switched to non-operational status (OFF). In this case, ASC OFF indicator light turns ON.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004E00ENG.html", "ASC warning light blinks while TCS function is in operation and indicates to the driver that the function is in operation.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004E00ENG.html", "M.U.T.-III SE can be used to diagnose the system diagnosis.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004E00ENG.html", "Fail-safe function is adopted. When a malfunction occurs in TCS function, the control is suspended for ASC function, TCS function, brake limited slip differential (BLSD) function, brake assist function, brake force distribution function, and hill start assist function. The vehicle status becomes the same as models without ASC function, TCS function, brake limited slip differential (BLSD) function, brake assist function, brake force distribution function, hill start assist function, and hill decent control. However, ABS function and EBD function are operated normally. Refer to .", "ptxt");
