si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O000BX00ENG.html", "System Description", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O000BX00ENG.html", "Hill decent control function supports the driver at a downhill drive (off road) by automatically intervening with the brakes and holding at the specified speed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O000BX00ENG.html", "This function operates when the vehicle is on a downhill slope of slope ratio 5% or more and electric shift selector is in the position D or R.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O000BX00ENG.html", "Activation and deactivation of the Hill decent control-function are done by pressing the HDC button on the dashboard. If necessary the driver can vary the target speed by means of application of the brake pedal or throttle pedal.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O000BX00ENG.html", "Fail-safe function is adopted. When a malfunction occurs in hill start assist function, the control is suspended for VDC function, TCS function, brake limited slip differential (BLSD) function, brake assist function, brake force distribution function, and hill start assist function. The vehicle status becomes the same as models without VDC function, TCS function, brake limited slip differential (BLSD) function, brake assist function, brake force distribution function, hill start assist function, and Hill decent control function. Refer to Fail-Safe.", "ptxt");
