si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004J00ENG.html", "When the driver brakes hard in an emergency, the stopping distance is reduced by increasing brake fluid pressure.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004J00ENG.html", "Fail-safe function is adopted. When a malfunction occurs in brake assist function, the control is suspended for ASC function, TCS function, brake limited slip differential (BLSD) function, brake assist function, brake force distribution function, and hill start assist function. The vehicle status becomes the same as models without ASC function, TCS function, brake limited slip differential (BLSD) function, brake assist function, brake force distribution function, hill start assist function, and hill decent control. Refer to .", "ptxt");
