si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004K00ENG.html", "System Description", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004K00ENG.html", "Brake force distribution function helps provide a more stable and secure feeling.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004K00ENG.html", "During cornering, when brake operation is performed brake fluid pressure of each wheel is controlled based on steering operation amount by the driver and vehicle cornering status amount detected by each sensor.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004K00ENG.html", "Fail-safe function is adopted. When a malfunction occurs in brake force distribution function, the control is suspended for ASC function, TCS function, brake limited slip differential (BLSD) function, brake assist function, brake force distribution function, and hill start assist function. The vehicle status becomes the same as models without ASC function, TCS function, brake limited slip differential (BLSD) function, brake assist function, brake force distribution function, and hill start assist function. However ABS function and EBD function are operated normally. Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O0004K00ENG.html", "Brake force distribution function may not always be operates in all driving conditions.", "ptxt");
