si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O000BY00ENG.html", "System Description", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O000BY00ENG.html", "The ABS actuator and electric unit (control unit) judges whether the TSA function should be activated according to the signals (G &yaw rate sensor, steering angular velocity sensor and wheel speed sensor) when a rolling is caused by the trailer vehicle. The system illuminates the stoplights automatically when the TSA control is activated.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O000BY00ENG.html", "When the ABS actuator and electric unit (control unit) uses various sensor signals to detect an rolling, which is caused by the trailer vehicle during towing, the system controls the engine output and the road wheel brakes to stabilize the vehicle attitude. When the TSA function activates the brake control, the stoplights illuminate.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5060304O000BY00ENG.html", "Fail-safe function is adopted. When a malfunction occurs in TSA function, the control is suspended for ASC function, TCS function, brake limited slip differential (BLSD) function, brake assist function, brake force distribution function, and hill start assist function. The vehicle status becomes the same as models without ASC function, TCS function, brake limited slip differential (BLSD) function, brake assist function, brake force distribution function, hill start assist function, hill decent control, and TSA function. However, ABS function and EBD function are operated normally. Refer to .", "ptxt");
