si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304B0000L00ENG.html", "Precaution for Supplemental Restraint System (SRS) \"AIR BAG\" and \"SEAT BELT PRE-TENSIONER\"", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304B0000L00ENG.html", "The Supplemental Restraint System such as \"AIR BAG\" and \"SEAT BELT PRE-TENSIONER\", used along with a front seat belt, helps to reduce the risk or severity of injury to the driver and front passenger for certain types of collision.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304B0000L00ENG.html", "Information necessary to service the system safely is included in the \"SRS AIR BAG\" and \"SEAT BELT\" of this Service Manual.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304B0000L00ENG.html", "Always observe the following items for preventing accidental activation.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304B0000L00ENG.html", "To avoid rendering the SRS inoperative, which could increase the risk of personal injury or death in the event of a collision that would result in air bag inflation, it is recommended that all maintenance and repair be performed by an authorized Mitsubishi Motors dealer.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304B0000L00ENG.html", "Improper repair, including incorrect removal and installation of the SRS, can lead to personal injury caused by unintentional activation of the system. For removal of Spiral Cable and Air Bag Module, see \"SRS AIR BAG\".", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304B0000L00ENG.html", "Never use electrical test equipment on any circuit related to the SRS unless instructed to in this Service Manual. SRS wiring harnesses can be identified by yellow harnesses or harness connectors.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304B0000L00ENG.html", "PRECAUTIONS WHEN USING POWER TOOLS (AIR OR ELECTRIC) AND HAMMERS", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304B0000L00ENG.html", "When working near the Air Bag Diagnosis Sensor Unit or other Air Bag System sensors with the ignition/power switch ON or engine running, never use air or electric power tools or strike near the sensor(s) with a hammer. Heavy vibration could activate the sensor(s) and deploy the air bag(s), possibly causing serious injury.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304B0000L00ENG.html", "When using air or electric power tools or hammers, always switch the ignition/power switch OFF, disconnect the 12V battery or batteries, and wait at least 3 minutes before performing any service.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "Precautions for Removing Battery Terminal", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "With the adoption of Auto ACC function, ACC power is automatically supplied by operating the keyless operation key or remote keyless entry or by opening/closing the driver side door. In addition, ACC power is supplied even after the ignition switch is turned to the OFF position, i.e. ACC power is supplied for a certain fixed time.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "When disconnecting the 12V battery terminal, turn off the ACC power before disconnecting the 12V battery terminal, observing \"How to disconnect 12V battery terminal\" described below.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "Some ECUs operate for a certain fixed time even after ignition switch is turned OFF and ignition power supply is stopped. If the battery terminal is disconnected before ECU stops, accidental DTC detection or ECU data damage may occur.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "For vehicles with the 2-batteries, be sure to connect the main battery and the sub battery before turning ON the ignition switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "If the ignition switch is turned ON with any one of the terminals of main battery and sub battery disconnected, then DTC may be detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "After installing the 12V battery, always check the DTC of all ECUs and erase DTC.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "The removal of 12V battery may cause a DTC detection error.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "HOW TO DISCONNECT 12V BATTERY TERMINAL", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "Disconnect 12V battery terminal according to instruction described below.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "Open the hood.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "Turn ignition switch to the ON position.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "Turn ignition switch to the OFF position with the driver side door opened.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "Get out of the vehicle and close the driver side door.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "Wait at least 3 minutes.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "While waiting, never operate the vehicle such as locking, opening, and closing doors. Violation of this caution results in the activation of ACC power supply according to the Auto ACC function.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "Remove 12V battery terminal.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080302Y0000L00ENG.html", "After installing 12V battery, always check the DTC of all ECUs and erase DTC.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304Q0000D00ENG.html", "Driver Air Bag Module", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304Q0000D00ENG.html", "Driver air bag module is built into steering wheel.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304Q0000D00ENG.html", "Driver air bag module mainly consists of air bag  and inflator  which inflates air bag.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304R0000C00ENG.html", "Passenger Air Bag Module", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304R0000C00ENG.html", "Passenger air bag module is built into instrument panel assembly.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304R0000C00ENG.html", "Passenger air bag module mainly consists of air bag  and inflator  which inflates air bag.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304S0000D00ENG.html", "Driver Knee Air Bag Module", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304S0000D00ENG.html", "Driver knee air bag module is built into instrument panel assembly.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304S0000D00ENG.html", "Driver knee air bag module mainly consists of air bag  and inflator  which inflates air bag.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304U0000C00ENG.html", "Front Side Air Bag Module", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304U0000C00ENG.html", "Front side air bag module is built into seatback outside.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304U0000C00ENG.html", "Front side air bag module mainly consists of air bag  and inflator  which inflates air bag.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304V0000C00ENG.html", "Front Center Air Bag Module", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304V0000C00ENG.html", "Front center air bag module is built into seatback inside of driver seat.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304V0000C00ENG.html", "Front center air bag module mainly consists of air bag  and inflator  which inflates air bag.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304X0000C00ENG.html", "Curtain Air Bag Module", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304X0000C00ENG.html", "Curtain air bag module is built into roof side portion.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304X0000C00ENG.html", "Curtain air bag module mainly consists of air bag  and inflator  which inflates air bag.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304Z0000A00ENG.html", "Driver Air Bag Inflator", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304Z0000A00ENG.html", "Driver air bag inflator  mainly consists of electric ignition device (squib), igniting agent, gas generating agent, and filter. These items are stored in a container.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304Z0000A00ENG.html", "In a frontal collision which exceeds the specified limit of the vehicle, electric ignition device (squib) ignites igniting agent. Gas generating agent burns due to heat from igniting agent. Generated gas (high temperature) inflates air bag through filter.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304Z0000A00ENG.html", "Filter removes and cools residues of gas generating agent.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304R0000A00ENG.html", "Passenger Air Bag Module", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304R0000A00ENG.html", "Passenger air bag module is built into instrument panel assembly.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304R0000A00ENG.html", "Passenger air bag module mainly consists of air bag  and inflator  which inflates air bag.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030510000F00ENG.html", "Driver Knee Air Bag Inflator", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030510000F00ENG.html", "Driver knee air bag inflator  mainly consists of electric ignition device (squib), igniting agent, gas generating agent, and filter. These items are stored in a container.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030510000F00ENG.html", "In a frontal collision which exceeds the specified limit of the vehicle, electric ignition device (squib) ignites igniting agent. Gas generating agent burns due to heat from igniting agent. Generated gas (high temperature) inflates air bag through filter.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030510000F00ENG.html", "Filter removes and cools residues of gas generating agent.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030530000C00ENG.html", "Front Side Air Bag Inflator", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030530000C00ENG.html", "Front side air bag inflator  mainly consists of electric ignition device (squib), igniting agent, gas generating agent, and filter. These items are stored in a cylinder-type container.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030530000C00ENG.html", "In a side collision which exceeds the specified limit of the vehicle, electric ignition device (squib) ignites igniting agent. Gas generating agent burns due to heat from igniting agent. Generated gas (high temperature) inflates air bag through filter.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030530000C00ENG.html", "Filter removes and cools residues of gas generating agent.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030540000C00ENG.html", "Front Center Air Bag Inflator", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030540000C00ENG.html", "Front center air bag inflator  mainly consists of electric ignition device (squib), heating agent, compressed gas, gas generating agent, filter, and diffuser. These items are stored in a cylinder-type container.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030540000C00ENG.html", "In a side collision which exceeds the specified limit of the vehicle, electric ignition device (squib) ignites igniting agent. Gas generating agent burns due to heat from igniting agent. Generated gas (high temperature) inflates air bag through filter.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030540000C00ENG.html", "Filter removes and cools residues of gas generating agent.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030560000D00ENG.html", "Curtain Air Bag Inflator", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030560000D00ENG.html", "Curtain air bag inflator  mainly consists of electric ignition device (squib), heating agent, compressed gas, and diffuser. These items are stored in a cylinder-type container.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030560000D00ENG.html", "In a side collision which exceeds the specified limit of the vehicle, electric ignition device (squib) ignites igniting agent. Gas generating agent burns due to heat from igniting agent, then, the generant compressed gas is released. Generated gas (high temperature) inflates air bag  through filter.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030560000D00ENG.html", "Filter removes and cools residues of gas generating agent.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030580000C00ENG.html", "Spiral Cable", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030580000C00ENG.html", "Spiral cable electrically connects air bag diagnosis sensor unit and driver air bag module. Spiral cable mainly consists of the rotating portion  which performs the same movement as steering wheel, the fixed case  which is installed on steering wheel, and the cable which connects the rotating portion.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030580000C00ENG.html", "Spiral cable is built into steering angle sensor which is installed to a space between combination switch and steering wheel.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030590000C00ENG.html", "Crash Zone Sensor", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030590000C00ENG.html", "Crush zone sensor  is installed to crash zone sensor bracket. Crash zone sensor integrates frontal collision “G” sensor which detects frontal collision impact that exceeds the specified limit of the vehicle.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030590000C00ENG.html", ": Vehicle front", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030590000C00ENG.html", "In a frontal collision that exceeds the specified limit of the vehicle, crush zone sensor detects impact. If frontal collision safing sensor in air bag diagnosis sensor unit judges that impact is due to a collision, driver air bag, passenger air bag, driver knee air bag, passenger knee air bag and seat belt pre-tensioner (front and rear) operate.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305A0000D00ENG.html", "Satellite Sensor", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305A0000D00ENG.html", "Front door satellite sensor  is installed to front door panel.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305A0000D00ENG.html", ": Vehicle front", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305A0000D00ENG.html", "B-pillar satellite sensor  is installed to center pillar lower portion of front seat belt retractor front side.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305A0000D00ENG.html", "C-pillar satellite sensor  is installed to luggage side lower finisher remove portion of the C-pillar.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305A0000D00ENG.html", "Front door satellite sensor is equipped with side collision pressure sensor which detects side collision impact that exceeds the specified limit of the vehicle.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305A0000D00ENG.html", "B-pillar and C-pillar satellite sensor are equipped with side collision G sensor which detects side collision impact that exceeds the specified limit of the vehicle.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305A0000D00ENG.html", "In a side collision that exceeds the specified limit of the vehicle, satellite sensor detects impact. If side collision safing sensor in air bag diagnosis sensor unit judges that impact is due to a collision, front side air bag, front center air bag, rear side air bag, curtain air bag and seat belt pre-tensioner operate.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305B0000G00ENG.html", "Air Bag Diagnosis Sensor Unit", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305B0000G00ENG.html", "Air bag diagnosis sensor unit  is installed to front seat center portion (under center console). Air bag diagnosis sensor unit integrates control functions of driver air bag, passenger air bag, driver knee air bag, passenger knee air bag, front side air bag, front center air bag, rear side air bag, curtain air bag and seat belt pre-tensioner.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305B0000G00ENG.html", ": Vehicle front", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305B0000G00ENG.html", "Air bag diagnosis sensor unit integrates frontal collision G sensor, frontal collision safing sensor, and side collision safing sensor.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305B0000G00ENG.html", "Air bag diagnosis sensor unit has a function that judges impact due to frontal and side collisions exceeding the specified limit of the vehicle. Air bag diagnosis sensor unit also has an auxiliary power supply function that supplements battery power supply in the event battery is damaged in a collision.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305B0000G00ENG.html", "Air bag diagnosis sensor unit diagnoses electric system of entire air bag system. Self-diagnosis function is adopted, which indicates system malfunction by turning ON air bag warning light on combination meter when a malfunction is detected. Diagnosis using M.U.T.-III SE is possible.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305C0000C00ENG.html", "Air Bag Warning Light", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305C0000C00ENG.html", "Air bag warning light turns ON or blinks indicating a system malfunction when a malfunction is detected for electric system of SRS air bag system and seat belt pre-tensioner system.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305C0000C00ENG.html", "For operation check purposes, air bag warning light turns ON for 7 seconds after power switch is turned ON. During this period of time, air bag diagnosis sensor unit performs system diagnosis.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305C0000C00ENG.html", "SRS air bag and seat belt pre-tensioner do not operate for approximately 7 seconds (air bag warning light is turning ON) after power switch is turned ON.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305D0000A00ENG.html", "Occupant Detection System Sensor", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305D0000A00ENG.html", "Occupant detection system sensor installed in the passenger seat cushion pad.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305D0000A00ENG.html", "Occupant detection system sensor transmits the passenger seat status (occupied or empty) to occupant detection system control unit.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305E0000A00ENG.html", "Occupant detection system control unit", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305E0000A00ENG.html", "Occupant detection system control unit installed in the passenger seat cushion frame.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305E0000A00ENG.html", "Occupant detection system control unit transmits the passenger seat status (occupied or empty) to air bag diagnosis sensor unit.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305Q0000700ENG.html", "Front Passenger Air Bag ON/OFF Indicator", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080305Q0000700ENG.html", "Front passenger air bag ON/OFF indicator indicates whether or not passenger air bag is in the activation mode based on the judgment of occupant detection system.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304E0000400ENG.html", "Caution Labels", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080304E0000400ENG.html", "The labels indicating the precautions for handling and maintenance of SRS air bags and seat belt pre-tensioner are attached to the locations shown in the figure. If the label is damaged or is dirty, replace with the new label.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "When SRS is activated in a collision", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "FOR FRONTAL COLLISION: When SRS is activated in a collision", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Due to varying models and option levels, not all parts listed in the chart below apply to all vehicles.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "WORK PROCEDURE", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Before performing any of the following steps, ensure that all vehicle body and structural repairs have been completed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Replace the diagnosis sensor unit.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Remove the front air bag modules, knee air bag module, crash zone sensor assembly, bracket and seat belt pre-tensioner assemblies.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Check the SRS components using the table below.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Replace any SRS components showing visible signs of damage. (dents, cracks and deformation, etc).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Install new front air bag modules, knee air bag module, crash zone sensor assembly, bracket and seat belt pre-tensioner assemblies.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Perform self-diagnosis using M.U.T.-III SE or air bag warning light. Refer to DTCIndex. for details.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Ensure entire SRS operates properly.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "After the work is completed, check that no malfunction is detected by air bag warning light.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "If an emergency call is made after the air bag has been deployed, the following operations must be performed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "With M.U.T.-III SE", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Select “Automatic notification prevention lock release” mode of “IVC” using M.U.T.-IIISE.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Select \"OK\" to unlock.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "SRS INSPECTION (FOR FRONTAL COLLISION)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Part", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Inspection", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Driver air bag module", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "If the driver air bag has deployed:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "REPLACE", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Install with new fasteners.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Driver knee air bag module", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "If the driver knee air bag has deployed:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Front passenger air bag module", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "If the front passenger air bag has deployed:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Crash zone sensor", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "If any of the front air bags or seat belt pre-tensioners* have been activated:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "REPLACE the crash zone sensor and bracket with new fasteners.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "*: Confirm seat belt pre-tensioner activation using M.U.T.-III SE only.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Seat belt pre-tensioner assemblies", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "(All applicable locations: buckle, retractor, lap outer)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "If either the driver or passenger seat belt pre-tensioner* has been activated:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "REPLACE all seat belt pre-tensioner assemblies with new fasteners.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Diagnosis sensor unit", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "If any of the SRS components have been activated:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "REPLACE the diagnosis sensor unit.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Steering wheel", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Visually check steering wheel for deformities.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Check harness (built into steering wheel) and connectors for damage, and terminals for deformities.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Install driver air bag module into the steering wheel to check fit and alignment with the wheel.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Check steering wheel for excessive free play.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "If no damage is found, reinstall.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "If damaged - REPLACE.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Spiral cable", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "If the driver front air bag has deployed:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "REPLACE the spiral cable.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Occupant detection system (Passenger seat)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "REPLACE the seat cushion assembly.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Harness and connectors", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Check connectors for poor connection, damage, and terminals for deformities.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Check harness for binding, chafing, cuts, or deformities.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "If no damage is found, reinstall the harness and connectors.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "If damaged - REPLACE the damaged harness. Do not attempt to repair, splice or modify any SRS harness.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "Instrument panel assembly", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "If the front passenger air bag and/or knee air bag has deployed:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303B0000Z00ENG.html", "REPLACE the instrument panel assembly. (integrated type)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "When SRS is not activated in a collision", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "FOR FRONTAL COLLISION: When SRS is not activated in a collision", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "Due to varying models and option levels, not all parts listed in the chart below apply to all vehicles.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "WORK PROCEDURE", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "Before performing any of the following steps, ensure that all vehicle body and structural repairs have been completed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "Check the SRS components using the table below.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "Replace any SRS components showing visible signs of damage. (dents, cracks and deformation, etc).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "Perform self-diagnosis using M.U.T.-III SE or air bag warning light. Refer to DTCIndex. for details.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "Ensure entire SRS operates properly.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "After the work is completed, check that no malfunction is detected by air bag warning light.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "SRS INSPECTION (FOR FRONTAL COLLISION)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "Part", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "Inspection", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "Driver air bag module", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "If the driver air bag has not been activated:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "Remove driver air bag module. Check harness cover and connectors for damage, terminals for deformities, and harness for binding.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "Install driver air bag module into the steering wheel to check fit and alignment with the wheel.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "If no damage is found, reinstall with new fasteners.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "If damaged - REPLACE. Install driver air bag modules with new fasteners.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "Driver knee air bag module", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "If the driver knee air bag has not been activated:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "Remove driver knee air bag module. Check harness cover and connectors for damage, terminals for deformities, and harness for binding.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "Install driver knee air bag module into the instrument panel to check fit with the instrument panel.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5080303C0000R00ENG.html", "If damaged - REPLACE. Install driver knee air bag modules with new fasteners.", "ptxt");
