si[i++] = gsitm("N508030310008L00ENG.html", "After installation is completed, perform self-diagnosis using M.U.T.-III SE or air bag warning light, if the system is normal and \"Stored DTC\" of \"Self-diagnosis\" is indicated, always perform \"Erase DTCs\" of \"Self-diagnosis\" using M.U.T.-III SE. Refer to Work Flow .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N508030310008L00ENG.html", "After the work is completed, check that no system malfunction is detected by air bag warning light in the user mode.", "ptxt");
