si[i++] = gsitm("N511090900000700ENG.html", "GENERAL INFORMATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N511090900000700ENG.html", "For the items not described, refer to \"FUNDAMENTALS\" and \"REPAIR INFORMATION\".", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N511090AA0000G00ENG.html", "BODY SEALING LOCATIONS", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N511090AA0000G00ENG.html", "If the sealant application is directly visible on the outer plate and requires appearance quality of the application in areas such as the drip rail, pillar, clinch and so on, then apply the sealant so that it is flat, or wipe off any excess mounding after the application. Be careful not to obstruct the water draining hole.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N511090AA0000G00ENG.html", "The bold dotted line indicates the application area on the underside.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N511090AA0000G00ENG.html", "UPPER BODY", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N511090AA0000G00ENG.html", "SIDE BODY", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N511090AB0000C00ENG.html", "UNDERCOAT APPLICATION LOCATIONS", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N511090AB0000C00ENG.html", "The under parts of the body is undercoated for anti-corrosive, anti-rust, anti-chipping and anti-vibration performance.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N511090AB0000C00ENG.html", "After correcting the body, restore as shown in the instructions of the figure, if necessary.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N511090AB0000C00ENG.html", "To avoid splashing of undercoat material during the coating, protect component installation holes with masking tape.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N511090AD0000H00ENG.html", "LOCATION OF SYNTHETIC-RESIN PARTS", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N511090AD0000H00ENG.html", "Synthetic-resin parts may be deformed by heat. So before the service, refer to the heat-resistant temperature written in the chart below, then remove the parts if necessary.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N511090AD0000H00ENG.html", "The material of each of the principal synthetic-resin parts is shown below.", "ptxt");
