si[i++] = gsitm("N512010330009000ENG.html", "REMOVAL AND INSTALLATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N512010330009000ENG.html", "When you remove/install or replace the camera, you should check the camera image on the multi-around monitor \"Bird-eye view.\" If necessary, calibrate the monitor (Refer to Basic Inspection for Multi-around Monitor ). &lt;Vehicles with multi-around monitor>", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N512010330009000ENG.html", "To ensure the camera image is clearly visible, wipe the lens with a damped rag and then a dry rag to remove dust, rain drops or snow.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N512010330009000ENG.html", "Be careful not to damage the camera. Any damage may have an adverse effect on the screen image.", "ptxt");
