si[i++] = gsitm("N512020240003P00ENG.html", "A short circuit is detected multiple times in the front fog light LH power supply circuit, and damage accumulates at the smart FET inside the IPDM E/R. For this reason, IPDM E/R does not turn ON the smart FET. Because the DTC cannot be reproduced in this state, perform  and replace IPDM E/R after the malfunctioning part is repaired. Refer to .", "ptxt");
