si[i++] = gsitm("N512010330007X00ENG.html", "Removal and Installation", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N512010330007X00ENG.html", "Wiper and washer switch is integrated in the combination switch. Refer to Combination Switch .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5122301W0000200ENG.html", "WIPER DEICER INSPECTION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5122301W0000200ENG.html", "When relocating the car between locations with extremely different temperatures (warm and cold), leave the car in the location for a while to adapt to the temperature prior to checking it.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5122301W0000200ENG.html", "Remove the front deck garnish (Refer to ).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5122301W0000200ENG.html", "Check that the resistance value between the connector terminals shown in the illustration is at the standard value.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5122301W0000200ENG.html", "Standard value: 2.69 ± 0.4 Ω at 23°C", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503W0000P00ENG.html", "Precaution for Supplemental Restraint System (SRS) \"AIR BAG\" and \"SEAT BELT PRE-TENSIONER\"", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503W0000P00ENG.html", "The Supplemental Restraint System such as “AIR BAG” and “SEAT BELT PRE-TENSIONER”, used along with a front seat belt, helps to reduce the risk or severity of injury to the driver and front passenger for certain types of collision.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503W0000P00ENG.html", "Information necessary to service the system safely is included in the “SRS AIR BAG” and “SEAT BELT” of this Service Manual.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503W0000P00ENG.html", "Always observe the following items for preventing accidental activation.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503W0000P00ENG.html", "To avoid rendering the SRS inoperative, which could increase the risk of personal injury or death in the event of a collision that would result in air bag inflation, it is recommended that all maintenance and repair be performed by an authorized Mitsubishi Motors dealer.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503W0000P00ENG.html", "Improper repair, including incorrect removal and installation of the SRS, can lead to personal injury caused by unintentional activation of the system. For removal of Spiral Cable and Air Bag Module, see “SRS AIR BAG”.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503W0000P00ENG.html", "Never use electrical test equipment on any circuit related to the SRS unless instructed to in this Service Manual. SRS wiring harnesses can be identified by yellow harnesses or harness connectors.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503W0000P00ENG.html", "PRECAUTIONS WHEN USING POWER TOOLS (AIR OR ELECTRIC) AND HAMMERS", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503W0000P00ENG.html", "When working near the Air Bag Diagnosis Sensor Unit or other Air Bag System sensors with the ignition/power switch ON or engine running, never use air or electric power tools or strike near the sensor(s) with a hammer. Heavy vibration could activate the sensor(s) and deploy the air bag(s), possibly causing serious injury.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503W0000P00ENG.html", "When using air or electric power tools or hammers, always switch the ignition/power switch OFF, disconnect the 12V battery or batteries, and wait at least 3 minutes before performing any service.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "Precautions for Removing Battery Terminal", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "With the adoption of Auto ACC function, ACC power is automatically supplied by operating the keyless operation key or remote keyless entry or by opening/closing the driver side door. In addition, ACC power is supplied even after the ignition switch is turned to the OFF position, i.e. ACC power is supplied for a certain fixed time.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "When disconnecting the 12V battery terminal, turn off the ACC power before disconnecting the 12V battery terminal, observing “How to disconnect 12V battery terminal” described below.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "Some ECUs operate for a certain fixed time even after ignition switch is turned OFF and ignition power supply is stopped. If the battery terminal is disconnected before ECU stops, accidental DTC detection or ECU data damage may occur.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "For vehicles with the 2-batteries, be sure to connect the main battery and the sub battery before turning ON the ignition switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "If the ignition switch is turned ON with any one of the terminals of main battery and sub battery disconnected, then DTC may be detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "After installing the 12V battery, always check the DTC of all ECUs and erase DTC.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "The removal of 12V battery may cause a DTC detection error.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "HOW TO DISCONNECT 12V BATTERY TERMINAL", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "Disconnect 12V battery terminal according to instruction described below.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "Open the hood.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "Turn ignition switch to the ON position.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "Turn ignition switch to the OFF position with the driver side door opened.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "Get out of the vehicle and close the driver side door.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "Wait at least 3 minutes.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "While waiting, never operate the vehicle such as locking, opening, and closing doors. Violation of this caution results in the activation of ACC power supply according to the Auto ACC function.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "Remove 12V battery terminal.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120502Y0000V00ENG.html", "After installing 12V battery, always check the DTC of all ECUs and erase DTC.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500W0000T00ENG.html", "Component Parts Location", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500W0000T00ENG.html", "Door mirror", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500W0000T00ENG.html", "(Door mirror defogger*)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500W0000T00ENG.html", "BCM", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500W0000T00ENG.html", "Refer to . for detailed installation location.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500W0000T00ENG.html", "Rear window defogger", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500W0000T00ENG.html", "A/C switch assembly", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500W0000T00ENG.html", "(Rear window defogger switch)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500W0000T00ENG.html", "A/C amp.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500W0000T00ENG.html", "Rear window defogger relay", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500W0000T00ENG.html", "Fuse block (J/B)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500W0000T00ENG.html", "Vehicle front", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500W0000T00ENG.html", "*: With door mirror defogger", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Y0000N00ENG.html", "Rear Window Defogger", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Y0000N00ENG.html", "COMPONENT FUNCTION WITHIN SYSTEM", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Y0000N00ENG.html", "Electricity flows to the heat wire (rear window defogger) contained inside the liftgate window glass, and the liftgate window glass is heated to eliminated the fogging.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Y0000N00ENG.html", "INDIVIDUAL COMPONENT FUNCTION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Y0000N00ENG.html", "Heats the heating wire.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Y0000N00ENG.html", "COMPONENT OPERATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Y0000N00ENG.html", "When the rear window defogger switch is turned ON, current flows to the rear window defogger, heating the heat wires.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Y0000N00ENG.html", "COMPONENT PARTS LOCATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Y0000N00ENG.html", "Contained inside the liftgate window glass.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Y0000N00ENG.html", "Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Z0000D00ENG.html", "Door Mirror Defogger", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Z0000D00ENG.html", "COMPONENT FUNCTION WITHIN SYSTEM", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Z0000D00ENG.html", "Electricity flows to the heat wire (mirror defogger) contained inside the glass mirror, and the glass mirror is heated to eliminated the fogging.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Z0000D00ENG.html", "INDIVIDUAL COMPONENT FUNCTION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Z0000D00ENG.html", "Heats the heating wire.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Z0000D00ENG.html", "COMPONENT OPERATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Z0000D00ENG.html", "When the rear window defogger switch is turned ON, current flows to the mirror defogger, heating the heat wires.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Z0000D00ENG.html", "COMPONENT PARTS LOCATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Z0000D00ENG.html", "Contained inside the glass mirror.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503Z0000D00ENG.html", "Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N512050400000D00ENG.html", "Rear Window Defogger Relay", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N512050400000D00ENG.html", "COMPONENT FUNCTION WITHIN SYSTEM", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N512050400000D00ENG.html", "This relay activates according to the rear window defogger relay control signal that is controlled by BCM, and activates the defogger system.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N512050400000D00ENG.html", "INDIVIDUAL COMPONENT FUNCTION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N512050400000D00ENG.html", "It turns the relay switch ON/OFF and sends a current from the battery to the defogger system.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N512050400000D00ENG.html", "COMPONENT OPERATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N512050400000D00ENG.html", "The rear window defogger relay utilizes a normal open relay.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N512050400000D00ENG.html", "COMPONENT PARTS LOCATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N512050400000D00ENG.html", "The rear window defogger relay is installed to the fuse block (J/B).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N512050400000D00ENG.html", "Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "System Description", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "SYSTEM DIAGRAM", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Component", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Function", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "A/C amp.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "A/C amp. receives rear window defogger switch signal from A/C switch assembly via LIN communication and transmits rear window defogger request signal to BCM via CAN communication.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "A/C amp. receives rear window defogger feedback signal from BCM via CAN communication and transmits it to A/C switch assembly.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "BCM", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Receives rear window defogger request signal from A/C amp. via CAN communication.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Turns ON the rear window defogger relay based on the received signal.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Transmits rear window defogger feedback signal to A/C amp. via CAN communication.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Performs the timer control of rear window defogger and door mirror defogger*.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "A/C switch assembly", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "(Rear window defogger switch)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Rear window defogger switch is installed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Transmits rear window defogger switch signal to A/C amp. via LIN communication.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Receives rear window defogger feedback signal from A/C amp. via LIN communication.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Turns the indicator light ON when detecting the operation of rear window defogger door mirror defogger*.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Door mirror defogger*", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Refer to Component Description .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Rear window defogger", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Rear window defogger relay", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "*: With door mirror defogger", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "OPERATION DESCRIPTION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Turn rear window defogger switch ON when the engine running. Then A/C switch assembly transmits rear window defogger switch signal to A/C amp. via LIN communication line.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "A/C amp. transmits rear window defogger request signal to BCM via CAN communication.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "BCM turns rear window defogger relay ON and transmits rear window defogger feedback signal to A/C amp. via CAN communication when rear window defogger request signal is received.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Rear window defogger and door mirror defogger (with door mirror defogger) are supplied with power and operate when rear window defogger relay turns ON.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "A/C amp. transmit rear window defogger feedback signal to A/C switch assembly via LIN communication line when rear window defogger feedback signal is received.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "A/C switch assembly turns on the rear window defogger indicator light when rear window defogger feedback signal is received.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "When remote engine start function is operated, according to the vehicle situation* A/C amp. transmits the rear window defogger request signal to BCM via CAN communication. For details, refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "*: Depending on the vehicle situation (ambient temperature, in-vehicle temperature and sunload etc.) it is not operated.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "TIMER FUNCTION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "BCM turns rear window defogger relay ON for approximately 20 minutes when rear window defogger switch turns ON. It makes rear window defogger and door mirror defogger (with door mirror defogger) operate.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503K0000Q00ENG.html", "Timer is canceled after pressing rear window defogger switch again during timer operation. Then BCM turns rear window defogger relay OFF. The same reaction also occurs during timer operation, if the ignition switch is turned OFF.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503U0000O00ENG.html", "M.U.T.-III SE Function (BCM - REAR DEFOGGER)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503U0000O00ENG.html", "ACTUATOR TEST", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503U0000O00ENG.html", "Test Item", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503U0000O00ENG.html", "Description", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503U0000O00ENG.html", "Rear defogger", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503U0000O00ENG.html", "Rear window defogger operates when “On” on M.U.T.-III SE screen is touched", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503V0000G00ENG.html", "List of ECU Reference", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503V0000G00ENG.html", "ECU", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503V0000G00ENG.html", "Reference", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503V0000G00ENG.html", "BCM", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503V0000G00ENG.html", "Fail-safe", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503V0000G00ENG.html", "DTC Inspection Priority Chart", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503V0000G00ENG.html", "DTC Index", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Work Flow", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "OVERALL SEQUENCE", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "DETAILED FLOW", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "GET INFORMATION FOR SYMPTOM", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Get detailed information from the customer about the symptom (the condition and the environment when the incident/malfunction occurs).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Check operation condition of the function that is malfunctioning.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "GO TO 2.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "CHECK DTC", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Check DTC.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Perform the following procedure if DTC is detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Record DTC and freeze frame data (Print them out using M.U.T.-III SE.)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Erase DTC.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Study the relationship between the cause detected by DTC and the symptom described by the customer.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Check related service bulletins for information.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Are any symptoms described and any DTC detected?", "question");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Symptom is described, DTC is detected", "result");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "GO TO 3.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Symptom is described, DTC is not detected", "result");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "GO TO 4.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Symptom is not described, DTC is detected", "result");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "GO TO 5.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "CONFIRM THE SYMPTOM", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Try to confirm the symptom described by the customer.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Also study the normal operation and fail-safe related to the symptom.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Verify relation between the symptom and the condition when the symptom is detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "GO TO 6.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "PERFORM DTC CONFIRMATION PROCEDURE", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Perform DTC CONFIRMATION PROCEDURE for the detected DTC, and then check that DTC is detected again. At this time, always connect M.U.T.-III SE to the vehicle, and check self diagnostic results in real time.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "If two or more DTCs are detected, refer to DTC INSPECTION PRIORITY CHART, and determine trouble diagnosis order.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Freeze frame data is useful if the DTC is not detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Perform Component Function Check if DTC CONFIRMATION PROCEDURE is not included on Service Manual. This simplified check procedure is an effective alternative though DTC cannot be detected during this check.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "If the result of Component Function Check is NG, it is the same as the detection of DTC by DTC CONFIRMATION PROCEDURE.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Is DTC detected?", "question");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "YES", "result");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "GO TO 7.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "NO", "result");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Check according to Intermittent Incident.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "DETECT MALFUNCTIONING SYSTEM BY SYMPTOM DIAGNOSIS", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Detect malfunctioning system according to SYMPTOM DIAGNOSIS based on the confirmed symptom in step 4, and determine the trouble diagnosis order based on possible causes and symptom.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Is the symptom described?", "question");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Monitor input data from related sensors or check voltage of related module terminals using M.U.T.-III SE.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "DETECT MALFUNCTIONING PART BY DIAGNOSIS PROCEDURE", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Inspect according to Diagnosis Procedure of the system.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Is malfunctioning part detected?", "question");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "GO TO 8.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "REPAIR OR REPLACE THE MALFUNCTIONING PART", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Repair or replace the malfunctioning part.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Reconnect parts or connectors disconnected during Diagnosis Procedure again after repair and replacement.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Check DTC. If DTC is detected, erase it.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "GO TO 9.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "FINAL CHECK", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "When DTC is detected in step 2, perform DTC CONFIRMATION PROCEDURE again, and then check that the malfunction is repaired securely.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "When symptom is described by the customer, refer to confirmed symptom in step 3 or 4, and check that the symptom is not detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Is DTC detected and does symptom remain?", "question");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "YES-1", "result");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "DTC is detected: GO TO 7.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "YES-2", "result");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Symptom remains: GO TO 4.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120503R0000G00ENG.html", "Before returning the vehicle to the customer, always erase DTC.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500S0002J00ENG.html", "Component Function Check", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500S0002J00ENG.html", "CHECK REAR WINDOW DEFOGGER SWITCH FUNCTION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500S0002J00ENG.html", "Check that the indicator light of rear window defogger illuminates when rear window defogger switch ON.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500S0002J00ENG.html", "Is the inspection result normal?", "question");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500S0002J00ENG.html", "YES", "result");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500S0002J00ENG.html", "Rear window defogger switch function is OK.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500S0002J00ENG.html", "NO", "result");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120500S0002J00ENG.html", "Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5120501B0008I00ENG.html", "Diagnosis Procedure", "title");
