si[i++] = gsitm("N514010300000G00ENG.html", "RESET THE SYSTEM", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514010300000G00ENG.html", "Disconnect and connect the negative (-) terminal of the battery. Refer to the \"Required Procedure After Battery Disconnection\" (GENERAL INFORMATION - BASIC INSPECTION - INSPECTION AND ADJUSTMENT - ADDITIONAL SERVICE WHEN REMOVING BATTERY NEGATIVE TERMINAL) .", "ptxt");
