si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Y0000A00ENG.html", "Condition of Error Detection", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Y0000A00ENG.html", "DTC (e.g. U1000 and U1001) of CAN communication is indicated on SELF-DIAG RESULTS on M.U.T.-III SE if a CAN communication signal is not transmitted or received between units for 2 seconds or more.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Y0000A00ENG.html", "CAN COMMUNICATION SYSTEM ERROR", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Y0000A00ENG.html", "CAN communication line open (CAN-H, CAN-L, or both)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Y0000A00ENG.html", "CAN communication line short (ground, between CAN communication lines, other harnesses)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Y0000A00ENG.html", "Error of CAN communication control circuit of the unit connected to CAN communication line", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Y0000A00ENG.html", "WHEN DTC OF CAN COMMUNICATION IS INDICATED EVEN THOUGH CAN COMMUNICATION SYSTEM IS NORMAL", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Y0000A00ENG.html", "Removal/installation of parts: Error may be detected when removing and installing CAN communication unit and related parts while turning the ignition switch ON. (A DTC except for CAN communication may be detected.)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Y0000A00ENG.html", "Fuse blown out (removed): CAN communication of the unit may cease.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Y0000A00ENG.html", "Voltage drop: Error may be detected if voltage drops due to discharged battery when turning the ignition switch ON (Depending on the control unit which carries out CAN communication).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Y0000A00ENG.html", "Error may be detected if the power supply circuit of the control unit, which carries out CAN communication, malfunctions (Depending on the control unit which carries out CAN communication).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Y0000A00ENG.html", "Error may be detected if reprogramming is not completed normally.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Y0000A00ENG.html", "CAN communication system is normal if DTC of CAN communication is indicated on SELF-DIAG RESULTS of M.U.T.-III SE under the above conditions. Erase the memory of the self-diagnosis of each unit.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Z0000A00ENG.html", "Symptom When Error Occurs in CAN Communication System", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Z0000A00ENG.html", "In CAN communication system, multiple units mutually transmit and receive signals. Each unit cannot transmit and receive signals if any error occurs on CAN communication line. Under this condition, multiple control units related to the root cause malfunction or go into fail-safe mode.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Z0000A00ENG.html", "ERROR EXAMPLE", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Z0000A00ENG.html", "Each vehicle differs in symptom of each unit under fail-safe mode and CAN communication line wiring.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Z0000A00ENG.html", "Refer to  for the unit abbreviation.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140304Z0000A00ENG.html", "Example: TCM branch line open circuit", "title");
