si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001900ENG.html", "Description", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001900ENG.html", "After replaced IPDM E/R, it is necessary to perform control unit configuration with M.U.T.-III SE. (For details, refer to )", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001900ENG.html", "AFTER REPLACEMENT", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001900ENG.html", "When replacing IPDM E/R, write vehicle specification with M.U.T.-III SE vehicle configuration.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001900ENG.html", "When after replacing IPDM E/R, the following items must be performed. Or not doing so, IPDM E/R control function does not operate normally.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001900ENG.html", "Writing vehicle specification", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001900ENG.html", "Factory Mode OFF", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001400ENG.html", "Work Procedure", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001400ENG.html", "REPLACE IPDM E/R", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001400ENG.html", "Replace IPDM E/R. Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001400ENG.html", "GO TO 2.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001400ENG.html", "WRITING VEHICLE SPECIFICATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001400ENG.html", "Perform configuration (IPDM E/R). Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001400ENG.html", "GO TO 3.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001400ENG.html", "PERFORM THE FACTORY MODE OFF", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001400ENG.html", "Ignition switch ON.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001400ENG.html", "Select \"Factory Mode OFF\" in \"Special Function\" screen of \"IPDM E/R\".", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001400ENG.html", "Check the item No.1: Factory Mode and perform the following procedures by the set value.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001400ENG.html", "ON: Select \"OK\" and change the set value to \"OFF\".", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001400ENG.html", "OFF: No action required, work completed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001400ENG.html", "WORK END", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001A00ENG.html", "Description", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001A00ENG.html", "Vehicle specification needs to be written with M.U.T.-III SE because it is not written after replacing the IPDM E/R.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001A00ENG.html", "The configuration requires network connection. M.U.T.-III SE connects to network and then it downloads the configuration data from the server. Then M.U.T.-III SE writes the vehicle specification to the IPDM E/R.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001A00ENG.html", "Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001A00ENG.html", "For details the network connection and operation, refer to “M.U.T.-III SE Operation Manual”.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001A00ENG.html", "The configuration no need to “save” configuration data from the IPDM E/R. The configuration data is always generated freshly at the server and then downloaded to the M.U.T.-III SE.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001A00ENG.html", "Complete the procedure of “Configuration” in order.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001A00ENG.html", "If incorrect “Configuration”, incidents might occur.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040110001A00ENG.html", "Never perform “Configuration” except for new IPDM E/R.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001500ENG.html", "Work Procedure", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001500ENG.html", "WRITING VEHICLE SPECIFICATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001500ENG.html", "With M.U.T.-III SE", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001500ENG.html", "Perform writing vehicle specification to IPDM E/R following \"Automatic Configuration\" procedure of \"Configuration\" according to M.U.T.-III SE Operation Manual.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001500ENG.html", "Log in the network according to M.U.T.-III SE guidance.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001500ENG.html", "For details the network connection and operation, refer to “M.U.T.-III SE Operation Manual”.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N514040320001500ENG.html", "WORK END", "ptxt");
