si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603E0000A00ENG.html", "720", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603E0000A00ENG.html", "When replacing 12V battery, use the dedicated battery since the enhanced features are available.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603E0000A00ENG.html", "INDIVIDUAL OPERATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603E0000A00ENG.html", "PARTS LOCATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603E0000A00ENG.html", "The 12V battery is mounted in the engine room. Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "Harness Connector", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "HARNESS CONNECTOR (TAB-LOCKING TYPE)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "The tab-locking type connectors help prevent accidental looseness or disconnection.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "The tab-locking type connectors are disconnected by pushing or lifting the locking tab(s). Refer to the figure below.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "To prevent damage to the parts, never pull the harness or wires when disconnecting the connector.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "[Example]", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "HARNESS CONNECTOR (SLIDE-LOCKING TYPE)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "A new style slide-locking type connector is used on certain systems and components, especially those related to OBD.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "The slide-locking type connectors help prevent incomplete locking and accidental looseness or disconnection.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "The slide-locking type connectors are disconnected by pushing or pulling the slider. Refer to the figure below.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "To prevent damage to the parts, be careful not to damage the connector support bracket when disconnecting the connector.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "HARNESS CONNECTOR (LEVER LOCKING TYPE)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "Lever locking type harness connectors are used on certain control units and control modules such as ECM, ABS actuator and electric unit (control unit), etc.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "Lever locking type harness connectors are also used on super multiple junction (SMJ) connectors.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "Always confirm the lever is fully locked in place by moving the lever as far as it will go to ensure full connection.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "Always confirm the lever is fully released (loosened) before attempting to disconnect or connect these connectors to avoid damage to the connector housing or terminals.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5140603F0000A00ENG.html", "Control unit with single lever", "ptxt");
