si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002D00ENG.html", "Description", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002D00ENG.html", "When replacing the sonar control unit, always replace it with a new one. Sonar system does not operate properly in case of reuse of the sonar control unit from another vehicle.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002D00ENG.html", "Perform the following operations when replacing sonar control unit. For details, refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002D00ENG.html", "AFTER REPLACEMENT", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002D00ENG.html", "When after replacing sonar control unit, the following items must be performed. Or not doing so, sonar system does not operate normally.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002D00ENG.html", "Writing vehicle specification", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002D00ENG.html", "Writing MAC key", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002D00ENG.html", "Factory Mode OFF", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "Work Procedure", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "Perform the following procedures after replacing the sonar control unit.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "REPLACE SONAR CONTROL UNIT", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "Replace sonar control unit. Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "GO TO 2.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "PERFORM CONFIGURATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "Perform configuration. Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "GO TO 3.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "WRITING MAC KEY", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "Perform MAC key writing. Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "GO TO 4.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "PERFORM THE FACTORY MODE OFF", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "Ignition switch ON.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "Select \"Factory Mode OFF\" in \"Special Function\" screen of \"SONAR\".", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "Check the item No.1: Factory Mode and perform the following procedures by the set value.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "ON: Select \"OK\" and change the set value to \"OFF\".", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "OFF: No action required, work completed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001T00ENG.html", "WORK END", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002E00ENG.html", "Description", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002E00ENG.html", "Vehicle specification needs to be written with M.U.T.-III SE because it is not written after replacing the sonar control unit.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002E00ENG.html", "The configuration requires network connection. M.U.T.-III SE connects to network and then it downloads the configuration data from the server. Then M.U.T.-III SE writes the vehicle specification to the sonar control unit.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002E00ENG.html", "Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002E00ENG.html", "For details the network connection and operation, refer to “M.U.T.-III SE Operation Manual”.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002E00ENG.html", "The configuration no need to “save” configuration data from the sonar control unit. The configuration data is always generated freshly at the server and then downloaded to the M.U.T.-III SE.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002E00ENG.html", "Complete the procedure of “Configuration” in order.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002E00ENG.html", "If incorrect “Configuration”, incidents might occur.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001U00ENG.html", "Work Procedure", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001U00ENG.html", "WRITING VEHICLE SPECIFICATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001U00ENG.html", "With M.U.T.-III SE", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001U00ENG.html", "Perform writing vehicle specification to sonar control unit following \"Automatic Configuration\" procedure of \"Configuration\" according to M.U.T.-III SE Operation Manual.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001U00ENG.html", "Log in the network according to M.U.T.-III SE guidance.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001U00ENG.html", "For details the network connection and operation, refer to \"M.U.T.-III SE Operation Manual\".", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030320001U00ENG.html", "WORK END", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002F00ENG.html", "Description", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002F00ENG.html", "When replacing sonar control unit, it is necessary to write MAC key to sonar control unit. Write MAC key to sonar control unit according to \"MAC Key writing\" procedure of \"M.U.T.-III SE Operation Manual\". Refer to .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002F00ENG.html", "During MAC key writing, maintain the following conditions:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002F00ENG.html", "Ignition switch ON", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516030110002F00ENG.html", "M.U.T.-III SE is connected to internet", "ptxt");
