si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "Multi Around Monitor", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "PRECAUTIONS FOR THE HANDLING OF CAMERA SYSTEM", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "The camera system assists the detection of obstacles. When operating the vehicle, the safety must be confirmed and ensured directly by sight, using the mirrors.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "Distance shown by vehicle width guiding lines and predicted course lines may differ from actual distance depending on the number of passengers and fuel capacity. For this reason, these lines must be used only as a guide.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "With the camera lens characteristics, a distance shown on the screen may look different from actual distance or obstacles may look deformed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "The camera is a precision instrument. Always prevent a strong impact, such as high-pressure car wash. Failure to do this results in a malfunction.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "Adhesion of dirt, rain drops, and snow to the camera lens may lower the sharpness of camera image or cause an improper operation in MOD (Moving Object Detection) function or parking frame recognition function. These adherents must be removed with a soft wet cloth first, then with a dry soft cloth.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "Never damage the camera. Failure to do this may affect camera images.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "PRECAUTIONS FOR THE HANDLING OF MOD (MOVING OBJECT DETECTION)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "MOD (Moving Object Detection) does not inform the driver of stationary objects.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "MOD (Moving Object Detection) detects a moving object by processing image data of an image shown on the display. The detection performance of a moving object is limited.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "MOD (Moving Object Detection) may not operate properly when any of the following conditions is satisfied:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "Color and brightness of a moving object are similar to those of its background.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "Existence of blinking light, such as turn signal light", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "Reflection of a strong light, such as head light light from other vehicles or sun light.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "Inappropriate orientation of camera due to folded mirror.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "Non-moving objects, such as water droplets dripping on the camera lens, white smoke from the muffler or moving shadow may be detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N516040C40000K00ENG.html", "Detection may not be performed properly depending on the speed, direction, distance, and shape of moving object.", "ptxt");
