si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103M0006I00ENG.html", "When lane markers in the traveling lane cannot be correctly detected for a period of time due to such items as a snow rut, reflection of light on a rainy day or several unclear lane markers are present", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103M0006I00ENG.html", "The control is automatically canceled", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103M0006I00ENG.html", "After the conditions are improved, the system can be set again", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103M0006I00ENG.html", "Unavailable", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103M0006I00ENG.html", "Adverse Weather", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103M0006I00ENG.html", "OFF", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103M0006I00ENG.html", "The front camera unit area of the windshield is fogged up or covered with dirt, water, drops, ice, snow, etc", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103M0006I00ENG.html", "Strong light, such as sunlight or high beams from oncoming vehicles, enter the front camera", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103M0006I00ENG.html", "A chime sounds and the control is automatically canceled.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103M0006I00ENG.html", "The system will be available when the above conditions no longer exist.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103M0006I00ENG.html", "If the warning message continues to appear, stop the vehicle in a safe location, turn the engine OFF and clean the windshield glass.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103M0006I00ENG.html", "Low Visibility", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Handling Precaution", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "DISTANCE SENSOR HANDLING", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Refer to Precautions for Predictive Forward Collision Warning(PFCW).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "FRONT CAMERA UNIT HANDLING", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Refer to Precautions for Lane Departure Warning.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "PRECAUTIONS FOR USING MI-PILOT", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Failure to follow the warnings and instructions for proper use of the MI-PILOT system could result in serious injury or death.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "MI-PILOT is not a self-driving system. Within the limits of its capabilities, as described in this manual, it helps the driver with certain driving activities.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The MI-PILOT system is not a replacement for proper driving procedures and is not designed to correct careless, inattentive or absent-minded driving. MI-PILOT does not always steer the vehicle to keep it in the lane. The MI-PILOT system is not designed to prevent loss of control. It is the driver’s responsibility to stay alert, drive safely, keep the vehicle in the traveling lane, and be in control of the vehicle at all times.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "There are limitations to the MI-PILOT system capability. The MI-PILOT system does not function in all driving, traffic, weather, and road conditions. It is the driver’s responsibility to stay alert, drive safely, keep the vehicle in the traveling lane, and be in control of the vehicle at all times.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The MI-PILOT system is only an aid to assist the driver and is not a collision warning or avoidance device.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The MI-PILOT system is for highway use only and is not intended for city driving. Failure to apply the brakes or steer the vehicle when necessary may result in a serious accident.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Always observe posted speed limits and do not set the speed over them.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Never take hands off the steering wheel when driving. Always keep hands on the steering wheel and drive the vehicle safely.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Never unfasten the safety belt when using MI-PILOT. Doing so automatically cancels the MI-PILOT system.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The MI-PILOT system does not react when approaching stationary and slow moving vehicles.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Always drive carefully and attentively when using the MI-PILOT system. Read and understand the Owner’s Manual thoroughly before using the MI-PILOT system. To avoid serious injury or death, do not rely on the system to prevent accidents or to control the vehicle’s speed in emergency situations. Do not use the MI-PILOT system except in appropriate road and traffic conditions.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When the accelerator pedal is depressed and the vehicle approaches the vehicle ahead, the ACC system neither controls the brake nor warn the driver with the chime and display. The driver must manually control the vehicle speed to maintain a safe distance to the vehicle ahead. Failure to do so could result in severe personal injury or death.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "To prevent the vehicle from moving or rolling unexpectedly, which could result in serious personal injury or property damage, before exiting the vehicle make sure to push the MI-PILOT switch to turn the system off, push the park button to shift to the P (Park) position, and turn the engine off.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Failure to follow the warnings and instructions for proper use of the ACC system could result in serious injury or death.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The ACC system is only an aid to assist the driver and is not a collision warning or avoidance device. It is recommended for highway use only and it is not intended for city driving. It is the driver’s responsibility to stay alert, drive safely, and be in control of the vehicle at all times.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "There are limitations to the ACC system capability. The ACC system does not function in all driving, traffic, weather, and road conditions. It is the driver’s responsibility to stay alert, drive safely, keep the vehicle in the traveling lane, and be in control of the vehicle at all times.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The ACC system does not react to stationary and slow moving vehicles.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Always drive carefully and attentively when using the ACC system. Read and understand the Owner’s Manual thoroughly before using the ACC system. To avoid serious injury or death, do not rely on the system to prevent accidents or to control the vehicle’s speed in emergency situations. Do not use the ACC system except in appropriate road and traffic conditions.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "In order to reduce the risk of a collision that may result in serious injury or death, please be aware of the following:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "This function is only activated with the right turn signal and briefly accelerates the vehicle even if a lane change is not initiated. This can include non-passing situations such as right side exits.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Ensure that when passing another vehicle, the adjacent lane is clear before initiating the pass. Sudden changes in traffic may occur while passing. Always manually steer or brake as needed. Never solely rely on the system.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Listed below are the system limitations for the Speed Limit Link. Failure to operate the vehicle in accordance with these system limitations could result in serious injury or death:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "It is the driver’s responsibility to select the proper speed, follow all traffic regulations and observe other road users.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "In the following situations, the Speed Limit Link may not operate properly and the actual speed limit sign may not be applied to the vehicle set speed properly. The driver must manually control the vehicle speed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When the Traffic Recognition Sign (TSR) system is not functioning properly or turned off.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When crossing national boundaries.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When driving in an area with nearby parallel roads (for example, freeway with a parallel service drive).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When driving in an area where each lane has a different speed limit sign.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When driving on a road under construction or in a construction zone.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Listed below are the system limitations for the ACC system. Failure to operate the vehicle in accordance with these system limitations could result in serious injury or death:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The ACC system is primarily intended for use on highways and freeways. It is not advisable to use the ACC system in city/urban traffic.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The ACC system does not adapt automatically to road conditions. This system should be used in evenly flowing traffic. Do not use the system on roads with sharp curves or on icy roads, in heavy rain or in fog.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "As there is a performance limit to the distance control function, never rely solely on the ACC system. This system does not correct careless, inattentive or absentminded driving or overcome poor visibility in rain, fog, or other bad weather. Decelerate the vehicle speed by depressing the brake pedal, depending on the distance to the vehicle ahead and the surrounding circumstances in order to maintain a safe distance between vehicles.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When the ACC system automatically brings the vehicle to a stop, the vehicle can automatically accelerate if the vehicle is stopped for less than approximately 3 seconds. Be prepared to stop the vehicle if necessary.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Always check surroundings before restarting the vehicle.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Always pay attention to the operation of the vehicle and be ready to manually control the proper following distance. The ACC system may not be able to maintain the selected distance between vehicles (following distance) or selected vehicle speed under some circumstances.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The ACC system does not detect the following objects:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Stationary or slow moving vehicles (when the vehicle is approaching them)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Pedestrians or objects in the roadway", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Oncoming vehicles in the same lane", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Motorcycles traveling offset in the travel lane", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The ACC system may not detect a vehicle ahead in certain road, weather or driving conditions. To avoid accidents, never use the ACC system under the following conditions:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "On roads with heavy, high-speed traffic or sharp curves", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "On slippery road surfaces such as on ice or snow, etc.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "On a bumpy road surface, such as an uneven dirt road", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "On steep downhill roads (the vehicle may go beyond the vehicle set speed and frequent braking may result in overheating the brakes)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "On repeated uphill and downhill roads", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "During bad weather (rain, fog, snow, etc.)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When the sensor detection is reduced (conditions such as rain, snow, fog, dust storms, sandstorms, and road spray from other vehicles)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When dirt, ice, snow or other material adhere to the radar sensor area", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When traffic conditions make it difficult to keep a proper distance between vehicles because of frequent acceleration or deceleration", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When a complicated-shaped vehicle such as a car carrier trailer or flatbed truck/trailer is near the vehicle ahead", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When there is interference by other radar sources", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When excessively heavy baggage is loaded in the rear seat or cargo area of the vehicle", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When towing a trailer or other vehicle", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "In some road or traffic conditions, a vehicle or object can unexpectedly come into the sensor detection zone and cause automatic braking. Always stay alert and avoid using the ACC system where not recommended in this warning section.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The ACC system also uses a multi-sensing front camera. The following are some conditions in which the camera may not properly detect a vehicle and detection of a vehicle ahead may be delayed:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Poor visibility (conditions such as rain, snow, fog, dust storms, sandstorms, and road spray from other vehicles)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The camera area of the windshield is fogged up or covered with dirt, water drops, ice, snow, etc.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Strong light (for example, sunlight or high beams from oncoming vehicles) enters the front camera", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "A sudden change in brightness occurs (for example, when the vehicle enters or exits a tunnel or shaded area or lightning flashes)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Failure to follow the warnings and instructions for proper use of the Lane Keep Assist (LKA) could result in serious injury or death.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The Lane Keep Assist (LKA) is not a replacement for proper driving procedures and is not designed to correct careless, inattentive or absent-minded driving. The Lane Keep Assist (LKA) does not always steer the vehicle to keep it in the lane. It is not designed to prevent loss of control. It is the driver’s responsibility to stay alert, drive safely, keep the vehicle in the traveling lane, and be in control of the vehicle at all times.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "As there is a performance limit to the Lane Keep Assist (LKA) capability, never rely solely on the system. The Lane Keep Assist (LKA) does not function in all driving, traffic, weather, and road conditions. Always drive safely, pay attention to the operation of the vehicle, and manually control the vehicle appropriately.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The Lane Keep Assist (LKA) is intended for use on well-developed highways with gentle (moderate) curves. To avoid risk of an accident, do not use this system on local or non-highway roads.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "The Lane Keep Assist (LKA) only steers the vehicle to maintain its position in the center of a lane. The vehicle does not steer to avoid objects in the road in front of the vehicle or to avoid a vehicle moving into the lane.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "It is the driver’s responsibility to stay alert, drive safely, keep the vehicle in the traveling lane, and be in control of the vehicle at all times. Never take hands off the steering wheel when driving. Always keep hands on the steering wheel and drive the vehicle safely.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Always drive carefully and attentively when using the Lane Keep Assist (LKA). Read and understand the Owner’s Manual thoroughly before using the Lane Keep Assist (LKA). To avoid serious injury or death, do not rely on the system to prevent accidents or to control the vehicle’s speed in emergency situations. Do not use the Lane Keep Assist (LKA) except in appropriate road and traffic conditions.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Lane Keep Assist (LKA) is not a system for a hands-free driving. Always keep hands on the steering wheel and drive the vehicle safely. Failure to do so could cause a collision resulting in serious personal injury or death.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "In the following situations, the camera may not detect lane markers correctly or may detect lane markers incorrectly and the Lane Keep Assist (LKA) may not operate properly:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When driving on roads where there are multiple parallel lane markers, lane markers that are faded or not painted clearly, non-standard lane markers, or lane markers covered with water, dirt, snow, etc.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When driving on roads with discontinued lane markers", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When driving on roads with a widening or narrowing lane width", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When driving on roads where there are multiple lanes or unclear lane markers due to road construction", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When driving on roads where there are sharply contrasting objects, such as shadows, snow, water, wheel ruts, seams, or lines remaining after road repairs (the Lane Keep Assist (LKA) could detect these items as lane markers)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When driving on roads where the traveling lane merges or separates", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Do not use the Lane Keep Assist (LKA) under the following conditions because the system may not properly detect lane markers. Doing so could cause a loss of vehicle control and result in an accident.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "During bad weather (rain, fog, snow, dust, etc.)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When rain, snow, sand, etc., is thrown up by the wheels of other vehicles", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When dirt, oil, ice, snow, water, or another object adheres to the camera unit", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When the lens of the camera unit is foggy", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When strong light (for example, sunlight or high beams from oncoming vehicles) shines on the camera", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When the headlights are not bright due to dirt on the lens or the headlights are off in tunnels or darkness", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When a sudden change in brightness occurs (for example, when the vehicle enters or exits a tunnel or is under a bridge)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When driving on roads where the traveling lane merges or separates or where there are temporary lane markers because of road construction", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When there is a lane closure due to road repairs", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When driving on a bumpy road surface, such as an uneven dirt road", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When driving on sharp curves or winding roads", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When driving on repeated uphill and downhill roads", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Do not use the Lane Keep Assist (LKA) under the following conditions because the system does not operate properly:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When driving with a tire that is not within normal tire conditions (for example, tire wear, abnormal tire pressure, installation of a spare tire, tire chains, non-standard wheels)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When the vehicle is equipped with non-original brake or suspension parts", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When an object such as a sticker or cargo obstructs the camera", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When excessively heavy baggage is loaded in the rear seat or luggage area of the vehicle", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When the vehicle load capacity is exceeded", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Excessive noise interferes with the warning chime sound, and the beep may not be heard.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "For the MI-PILOT system to operate properly, the windshield in front of the camera must be clean. Replace worn wiper blades. The correct size wiper blades must be used to help make sure the windshield is kept clean. Only use Mitsubishi Genuine wiper blades, or equivalent wiper blades, that are specifically designed for use on the vehicle model and model year.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "In the conventional (fixed speed) cruise control mode, a warning chime does not sound to warn the driver if you are too close to the vehicle ahead, as neither the presence of the vehicle ahead nor the vehicle-to-vehicle distance is detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Pay special attention to the distance between the vehicle and the vehicle ahead or a collision could occur.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Always confirm the setting in the ACC system display.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Do not use the conventional (fixed speed) cruise control mode when driving under the following conditions:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "When it is not possible to keep the vehicle at a set speed", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "In heavy traffic or in traffic that varies in speed", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "On winding or hilly roads", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "On slippery roads (rain, snow, ice, etc.)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "In very windy areas", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "Doing so could cause a loss of vehicle control and result in an accident.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000P00ENG.html", "To avoid accidentally engaging cruise control, make sure to turn the MI-PILOT switch off when not using the ACC system.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170104S0000400ENG.html", "M.U.T.-III SE Function (ACC/ADAS 2)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170104S0000400ENG.html", "Refer to M.U.T.-III SE Function (ACC/ADAS 2) .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170104T0000400ENG.html", "M.U.T.-III SE Function (LASER/RADAR)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170104T0000400ENG.html", "Refer to M.U.T.-III SE Function (LASER/RADAR) .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170104U0000300ENG.html", "M.U.T.-III SE Function (LANE CAMERA)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170104U0000300ENG.html", "Refer to M.U.T.-III SE Function (LANE CAMERA) .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001V00ENG.html", "List of ECU Reference", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001V00ENG.html", "ECU", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001V00ENG.html", "Reference", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001V00ENG.html", "ADAS control unit 2", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001V00ENG.html", "DTC Index", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001W00ENG.html", "List of ECU Reference", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001W00ENG.html", "ECU", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001W00ENG.html", "Reference", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001W00ENG.html", "Distance sensor", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001W00ENG.html", "DTC Index", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001X00ENG.html", "List of ECU Reference", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001X00ENG.html", "ECU", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001X00ENG.html", "Reference", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001X00ENG.html", "Front camera unit", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001X00ENG.html", "DTC Index", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "Work Flow", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "OVERALL SEQUENCE", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "DETAILED FLOW", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "INTERVIEW FOR MALFUNCTION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "It is also important to clarify the customer concerns before starting the inspection. Interview the customer about the concerns carefully and understand the symptoms fully.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "The customers are not professionals. Never assume that “maybe the customer means···” or “maybe the customer mentioned this symptom”.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "GO TO 2.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "SELF-DIAGNOSIS WITH M.U.T.-III SE", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "Perform “Read All DTCs” with M.U.T.-III SE.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "Check if any DTC is detected in self-diagnosis results of “LASER/RADAR”, “LANE CAMERA” and “ACC/ADAS 2”.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "Is any DTC detected?", "question");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "YES", "result");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "GO TO 5.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "NO", "result");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300003300ENG.html", "GO TO 3.", "ptxt");
