si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Handling Precaution", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "DISTANCE SENSOR HANDLING", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Refer to Precautions for Predictive Forward Collision Warning(PFCW).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "FRONT CAMERA UNIT HANDLING", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Refer to Precautions for Lane Departure Warning.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "PRECAUTIONS FOR USING ACC", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Failure to follow the warnings and instructions for proper use of the ACC system could result in serious injury or death.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "ACC is not a self-driving system. Within the limits of its capabilities, as described in this manual, it helps the driver with certain driving activities.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "The ACC system is not a replacement for proper driving procedures and is not designed to correct careless, inattentive or absent-minded driving. ACC does not always steer the vehicle to keep it in the lane. The ACC system is not designed to prevent loss of control. It is the driver’s responsibility to stay alert, drive safely, keep the vehicle in the traveling lane, and be in control of the vehicle at all times.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "There are limitations to the ACC system capability. The ACC system does not function in all driving, traffic, weather, and road conditions. It is the driver’s responsibility to stay alert, drive safely, keep the vehicle in the traveling lane, and be in control of the vehicle at all times.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "The ACC system is only an aid to assist the driver and is not a collision warning or avoidance device.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "The ACC system is for highway use only and is not intended for city driving. Failure to apply the brakes or steer the vehicle when necessary may result in a serious accident.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Always observe posted speed limits and do not set the speed over them.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Never take hands off the steering wheel when driving. Always keep hands on the steering wheel and drive the vehicle safely.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Never unfasten the safety belt when using ACC.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "The ACC system does not react when approaching stationary and slow moving vehicles.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Always drive carefully and attentively when using the ACC system. Read and understand the Owner’s Manual thoroughly before using the ACC system. To avoid serious injury or death, do not rely on the system to prevent accidents or to control the vehicle’s speed in emergency situations. Do not use the ACC system except in appropriate road and traffic conditions.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When the accelerator pedal is depressed and the vehicle approaches the vehicle ahead, the ACC system neither controls the brake nor warn the driver with the chime and display. The driver must manually control the vehicle speed to maintain a safe distance to the vehicle ahead. Failure to do so could result in severe personal injury or death.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "To prevent the vehicle from moving or rolling unexpectedly, which could result in serious personal injury or property damage, before exiting the vehicle make sure to push the ACC switch to turn the system off, push the park button to shift to the P (Park) position, and turn the engine off.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "The ACC system is only an aid to assist the driver and is not a collision warning or avoidance device. It is recommended for highway use only and it is not intended for city driving. It is the driver’s responsibility to stay alert, drive safely, and be in control of the vehicle at all times.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "The ACC system does not react to stationary and slow moving vehicles.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "In order to reduce the risk of a collision that may result in serious injury or death, please be aware of the following:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "This function is only activated with the right turn signal and briefly accelerates the vehicle even if a lane change is not initiated. This can include non-passing situations such as right side exits.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Ensure that when passing another vehicle, the adjacent lane is clear before initiating the pass. Sudden changes in traffic may occur while passing. Always manually steer or brake as needed. Never solely rely on the system.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Listed below are the system limitations for the Speed Limit Link. Failure to operate the vehicle in accordance with these system limitations could result in serious injury or death &lt;Vehicles for Australia>:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "It is the driver’s responsibility to select the proper speed, follow all traffic regulations and observe other road users.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "In the following situations, the Speed Limit Link may not operate properly and the actual speed limit sign may not be applied to the vehicle set speed properly. The driver must manually control the vehicle speed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When the Traffic Recognition Sign (TSR) system is not functioning properly or turned off.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When crossing national boundaries.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When driving in an area with nearby parallel roads (for example, freeway with a parallel service drive).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When driving in an area where each lane has a different speed limit sign.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When driving on a road under construction or in a construction zone.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Listed below are the system limitations for the ACC system. Failure to operate the vehicle in accordance with these system limitations could result in serious injury or death:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "The ACC system is primarily intended for use on highways and freeways. It is not advisable to use the ACC system in city/urban traffic.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "The ACC system does not adapt automatically to road conditions. This system should be used in evenly flowing traffic. Do not use the system on roads with sharp curves or on icy roads, in heavy rain or in fog.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "As there is a performance limit to the distance control function, never rely solely on the ACC system. This system does not correct careless, inattentive or absentminded driving or overcome poor visibility in rain, fog, or other bad weather. Decelerate the vehicle speed by depressing the brake pedal, depending on the distance to the vehicle ahead and the surrounding circumstances in order to maintain a safe distance between vehicles.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When the ACC system automatically brings the vehicle to a stop, the vehicle can automatically accelerate if the vehicle is stopped for less than approximately 3 seconds. Be prepared to stop the vehicle if necessary.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Always check surroundings before restarting the vehicle.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Always pay attention to the operation of the vehicle and be ready to manually control the proper following distance. The ACC system may not be able to maintain the selected distance between vehicles (following distance) or selected vehicle speed under some circumstances.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "The ACC system does not detect the following objects:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Stationary or slow moving vehicles (when the vehicle is approaching them)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Pedestrians or objects in the roadway", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Oncoming vehicles in the same lane", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Motorcycles traveling offset in the travel lane", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "The ACC system may not detect a vehicle ahead in certain road, weather or driving conditions. To avoid accidents, never use the ACC system under the following conditions:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "On roads with heavy, high-speed traffic or sharp curves", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "On slippery road surfaces such as on ice or snow, etc.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "On a bumpy road surface, such as an uneven dirt road", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "On steep downhill roads (the vehicle may go beyond the vehicle set speed and frequent braking may result in overheating the brakes)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "On repeated uphill and downhill roads", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "During bad weather (rain, fog, snow, etc.)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When the sensor detection is reduced (conditions such as rain, snow, fog, dust storms, sandstorms, and road spray from other vehicles)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When dirt, ice, snow or other material adhere to the radar sensor area", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When traffic conditions make it difficult to keep a proper distance between vehicles because of frequent acceleration or deceleration", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When a complicated-shaped vehicle such as a car carrier trailer or flatbed truck/trailer is near the vehicle ahead", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When there is interference by other radar sources", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When excessively heavy baggage is loaded in the rear seat or cargo area of the vehicle", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When towing a trailer or other vehicle", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "In some road or traffic conditions, a vehicle or object can unexpectedly come into the sensor detection zone and cause automatic braking. Always stay alert and avoid using the ACC system where not recommended in this warning section.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "The ACC system also uses a multi-sensing front camera. The following are some conditions in which the camera may not properly detect a vehicle and detection of a vehicle ahead may be delayed:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Poor visibility (conditions such as rain, snow, fog, dust storms, sandstorms, and road spray from other vehicles)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "The camera area of the windshield is fogged up or covered with dirt, water drops, ice, snow, etc.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Strong light (for example, sunlight or high beams from oncoming vehicles) enters the front camera", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "A sudden change in brightness occurs (for example, when the vehicle enters or exits a tunnel or shaded area or lightning flashes)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Excessive noise interferes with the warning chime sound, and the beep may not be heard.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "For the ACC system to operate properly, the windshield in front of the camera must be clean. Replace worn wiper blades. The correct size wiper blades must be used to help make sure the windshield is kept clean. Only use Mitsubishi Genuine wiper blades, or equivalent wiper blades, that are specifically designed for use on the vehicle model and model year.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "In the conventional (fixed speed) cruise control mode, a warning chime does not sound to warn the driver if you are too close to the vehicle ahead, as neither the presence of the vehicle ahead nor the vehicle-to-vehicle distance is detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Pay special attention to the distance between the vehicle and the vehicle ahead or a collision could occur.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Always confirm the setting in the ACC system display.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Do not use the conventional (fixed speed) cruise control mode when driving under the following conditions:", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "When it is not possible to keep the vehicle at a set speed", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "In heavy traffic or in traffic that varies in speed", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "On winding or hilly roads", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "On slippery roads (rain, snow, ice, etc.)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "In very windy areas", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "Doing so could cause a loss of vehicle control and result in an accident.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170101Q0000I00ENG.html", "To avoid accidentally engaging cruise control, make sure to turn the ACC switch off when not using the ACC system.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170104S0000500ENG.html", "M.U.T.-III SE Function (ACC/ADAS 2)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170104S0000500ENG.html", "Refer to M.U.T.-III SE Function (ACC/ADAS 2) .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170104T0000500ENG.html", "M.U.T.-III SE Function (LASER/RADAR)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170104T0000500ENG.html", "Refer to M.U.T.-III SE Function (LASER/RADAR) .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170104U0000400ENG.html", "M.U.T.-III SE Function (LANE CAMERA)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170104U0000400ENG.html", "Refer to M.U.T.-III SE Function (LANE CAMERA) .", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001A00ENG.html", "List of ECU Reference", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001A00ENG.html", "ECU", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001A00ENG.html", "Reference", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001A00ENG.html", "ADAS control unit 2", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001A00ENG.html", "DTC Index", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001B00ENG.html", "List of ECU Reference", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001B00ENG.html", "ECU", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001B00ENG.html", "Reference", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001B00ENG.html", "Distance sensor", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001B00ENG.html", "DTC Index", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001C00ENG.html", "List of ECU Reference", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001C00ENG.html", "ECU", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001C00ENG.html", "Reference", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001C00ENG.html", "Front camera unit", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N5170103W0001C00ENG.html", "DTC Index", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "Work Flow", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "OVERALL SEQUENCE", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "DETAILED FLOW", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "INTERVIEW FOR MALFUNCTION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "It is also important to clarify the customer concerns before starting the inspection. Interview the customer about the concerns carefully and understand the symptoms fully.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "The customers are not professionals. Never assume that “maybe the customer means···” or “maybe the customer mentioned this symptom”.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "GO TO 2.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "SELF-DIAGNOSIS WITH M.U.T.-III SE", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "Perform “Read All DTCs” with M.U.T.-III SE.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "Check if any DTC is detected in self-diagnosis results of “LASER/RADAR”, “LANE CAMERA” and “ACC/ADAS 2”.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "Is any DTC detected?", "question");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "YES", "result");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "GO TO 5.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "NO", "result");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "GO TO 3.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "ACTION TEST", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "Perform the ACC system action test to check the operation status. Refer to Work Procedure.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "Check if any other malfunctions occur.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "GO TO 4.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "SYMPTOM DIAGNOSIS", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "Perform the applicable diagnosis according to the diagnosis chart by symptom.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "GO TO 6.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "TROUBLE DIAGNOSIS BY DTC", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "Check the DTC in the self-diagnosis results.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "Perform trouble diagnosis for the detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "LASER/RADAR: Refer to DTC Index.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "LANE CAMERA: Refer to DTC Index.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "ACC/ADAS 2: Refer to DTC Index.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "If Network-DTC is detected, first diagnose the CAN communication system.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "MALFUNCTIONING PART REPAIR", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "Repair or replace the identified malfunctioning parts.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "GO TO 7.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "REPAIR CHECK (SELF-DIAGNOSIS WITH M.U.T.-III SE)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "Erases self-diagnosis results.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "Perform “Read All DTCs” again after repairing or replacing the malfunctioning parts.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "GO TO 8.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "REPAIR CHECK (ACTION TEST)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "Perform the ACC system action test. Check if the malfunction symptom is solved or no other symptoms occur.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "Is there any malfunction symptom?", "question");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002H00ENG.html", "INSPECTION END", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Work Flow", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "After the front camera unit or distance sensor are replaced or a problem with ACC is corrected, perform a test of ACC operation and check that ACC operates correctly.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Always drive safely when performing the action test.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR ACC SWITCH", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Start the engine.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Press the ACC switch (less than 1.5 seconds).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Information display status", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "ACC status indicator", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", ":", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "ON (Gray)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Speed control status indicator/warning", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Set vehicle speed indicator", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "“———”", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "““km/h”", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Set distance indicator", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Long mode", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Check that the vehicle information display on the combination meter indicates the set standby mode.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Press the ACC switch and check that the ACC indicator turns off when ACC is set to OFF.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Check that the ACC indicator is OFF after the engine is started again.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "GO TO 2.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR DISTANCE SWITCH", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Press the DISTANCE switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Check that the set distance indicator changes display in order of: (Long)→(Middle)→(Short).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "When the ACC switch is turned ON, initial setting set to (Long).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "GO TO 3.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR RES+, SET-, AND CANCEL SWITCHES", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Check that RES+, SET-, CANCEL switches are operated smoothly.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Check that switches come up as hand is released from the switches.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "GO TO 4.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "SET CHECKING (1)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Press the ACC switch (less than 1.5 seconds) and turn the ACC system ON.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Drive the vehicle at 30 km/h or more.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Push down the SET- switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Check that the desired speed is set and ACC control starts when releasing SET- switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "The set vehicle speed is indicated on the set vehicle speed indicator in the ACC system display on the information display.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "GO TO 5.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR INCREASE OF CRUISING SPEED (1)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Set the ACC at desired speed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Check that the set speed increases by 1 km/h as RES+ switch is pushed up.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "The maximum set speed of the ACC is 144 km/h.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Never set the cruise speed exceeding the posted speed limit.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "GO TO 6.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR DECREASE OF CRUISING SPEED (1)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Check that the set speed decreases by 1 km/h as SET- switch is pushed down.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "The minimum set speed is approximately 30 km/h.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Cancel the control automatically when the system does not detect any vehicle ahead.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "GO TO 7.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "SET CHECKING (2)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Stop the vehicle.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Drive the vehicle at less than approximately 30 km/h.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Push down the SET- switch when the system detects a vehicle ahead.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Check that the ACC is performed so that the vehicle maintains a proper distance according to the vehicle speed [maximum: approximately 30 km/h when releasing SET- switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "The ACC cannot be set when the vehicle speed is less than 30 km/h and when a vehicle ahead is not detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "The set vehicle speed indicator in the ACC system display on the information display is set to 30 km/h.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "GO TO 8.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR INCREASE OF CRUISING SPEED (2)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Set the ACC when the vehicle speed is less than approximately 30 km/h and when a vehicle ahead is detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "GO TO 9.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR DECREASE OF CRUISING SPEED (2)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Set the set vehicle speed to the desired vehicle speed according to “check for increase of cruising speed”.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "The minimum the set speed is approximately 30 km/h.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "GO TO 10.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR CANCELLATION OF ACC", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Check that the ACC is canceled when performing the following operations.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "When the brake pedal is depressed after ACC is set and the vehicle is driven.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "When the selector lever is in the “N” position after ACC is set and the vehicle is driven.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "When the ACC switch is turned OFF after ACC is set and the vehicle is driven.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "When the CANCEL switch is pressed after ACC is set and the vehicle is driven.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "GO TO 11.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR RESTORING SPEED THAT IS SET BY ACC BEFORE CANCELLATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Check that the vehicle restores the previous speed kept before the system deactivation when performing the following operations.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Drive the vehicle when the ACC is set and depress the brake pedal to cancel the control. Check that the vehicle restores the previous vehicle speed kept before the system deactivation when pushing up the RES+ switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Drive the vehicle when the ACC is set and shift the selector lever to the “N” position to cancel the control. Check that the vehicle restores the previous vehicle speed kept before the system deactivation when shifting the selector lever to the “D” position and pushing up the RES+ switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "Drive the vehicle when the ACC is set and press the CANCEL switch to cancel the control. Check that the vehicle restores the previous vehicle speed kept before the system deactivation when pushing up the RES+ switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002I00ENG.html", "INSPECTION END", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Work Flow", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "After the front camera unit or distance sensor are replaced or a problem with ACC is corrected, perform a test of ACC operation and check that ACC operates correctly.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Always drive safely when performing the action test.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR ACC SWITCH", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Start the engine.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Press the ACC switch (less than 1.5 seconds).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Information display status", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "ACC status indicator", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", ":", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "ON (Gray)", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Speed control status indicator/warning", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Set vehicle speed indicator", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "“———”", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "“km/h”", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Set distance indicator", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Long mode", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Check that the vehicle information display on the combination meter indicates the set standby mode.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Press the ACC switch and check that the ACC indicator turns off when ACC is set to OFF.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Check that the ACC indicator is OFF after the engine is started again.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "GO TO 2.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR DISTANCE SWITCH", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Press the DISTANCE switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Check that the set distance indicator changes display in order of: (Long)→(Middle)→(Short).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "When the ACC switch is turned ON, initial setting set to (Long).", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "GO TO 3.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR RES+, SET-, AND CANCEL SWITCHES", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Check that RES+, SET-, CANCEL switches are operated smoothly.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Check that switches come up as hand is released from the switches.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "GO TO 4.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "SET CHECKING (1)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Press the ACC switch (less than 1.5 seconds) and turn the ACC system ON.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Drive the vehicle at 30 km/h or more.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Push down the SET- switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Check that the desired speed is set and ACC control starts when releasing SET- switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "The set vehicle speed is indicated on the set vehicle speed indicator in the ACC system display on the information display.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "GO TO 5.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR INCREASE OF CRUISING SPEED (1)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Set the ACC at desired speed.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Check that the set speed increases by 1 km/h as RES+ switch is pushed up.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "The maximum set speed of the ACC is 144 km/h.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Never set the cruise speed exceeding the posted speed limit.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "GO TO 6.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR DECREASE OF CRUISING SPEED (1)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Check that the set speed decreases by 1 km/h as SET- switch is pushed down.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "The minimum set speed is approximately 30 km/h.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Cancel the control automatically when the system does not detect any vehicle ahead.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "GO TO 7.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "SET CHECKING (2)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Stop the vehicle.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Drive the vehicle at less than approximately 30 km/h.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Push down the SET- switch when the system detects a vehicle ahead.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Check that the ACC is performed so that the vehicle maintains a proper distance according to the vehicle speed (maximum: approximately 30 km/h) when releasing SET- switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "The ACC cannot be set when the vehicle speed is less than 30 km/h and when a vehicle ahead is not detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "The set vehicle speed indicator in the ACC system display on the information display is set to 30 km/h.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "GO TO 8.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR INCREASE OF CRUISING SPEED (2)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Set the ACC when the vehicle speed is less than approximately 30 km/h and when a vehicle ahead is detected.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "GO TO 9.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR DECREASE OF CRUISING SPEED (2)", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Set the set vehicle speed to the desired vehicle speed according to “check for increase of cruising speed”.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "The minimum the set speed is approximately 30 km/h.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "GO TO 10.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR CANCELLATION OF ACC", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Check that the ACC is canceled when performing the following operations.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "When the brake pedal is depressed after ACC is set and the vehicle is driven.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "When the selector lever is in the “N” position after ACC is set and the vehicle is driven.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "When the ACC switch is turned OFF after ACC is set and the vehicle is driven.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "When the CANCEL switch is pressed after ACC is set and the vehicle is driven.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "GO TO 11.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "CHECK FOR RESTORING SPEED THAT IS SET BY ACC BEFORE CANCELLATION", "title");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Check that the vehicle restores the previous speed kept before the system deactivation when performing the following operations.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Drive the vehicle when the ACC is set and depress the brake pedal to cancel the control. Check that the vehicle restores the previous vehicle speed kept before the system deactivation when pushing up the RES+ switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Drive the vehicle when the ACC is set and shift the selector lever to the “N” position to cancel the control. Check that the vehicle restores the previous vehicle speed kept before the system deactivation when shifting the selector lever to the “D” position and pushing up the RES+ switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "Drive the vehicle when the ACC is set and press the CANCEL switch to cancel the control. Check that the vehicle restores the previous vehicle speed kept before the system deactivation when pushing up the RES+ switch.", "ptxt");
si[i++] = gsitm("N517010300002J00ENG.html", "INSPECTION END", "ptxt");
